(152253,'A frost-laden music box, whispering melodies of loss, regret, and ambition forsaken. Holding this, one might almost hear the Frostbound Lady’s tearful lament - a reminder of the mage she once was and the fate she has faced.','一只覆霜的音乐盒，低语着失落、悔恨与弃置野心的旋律。握着它，几乎能听见霜缚女士含泪的哀歌——提醒着人们她曾是怎样一位法师，又遭遇了何种命运。'),
