(202431,'They say the banner of a true Blademaster does not simply follow the wind—it moves with the rhythm of combat itself, a crimson specter dancing in the storm of steel.','人们说，真正的剑圣旗帜不会只是随风飘动——它随战斗本身的节奏而动，如一道猩红幻影在钢铁风暴中起舞。'),
