(211273,'@Ascended Raid@Aydreath believed himself a noble protector of nature, but he was nothing more than a common beast in the end.','@Ascended Raid@艾德瑞斯自认为是自然的高贵守护者，但到头来他不过是一头寻常野兽。'),
(211275,'@Ascended Raid@You need not see the world around you. Listen only to their voice, and you will destroy it.','@Ascended Raid@你无需看清周遭的世界。只听他们的声音，你就会摧毁它。'),
(211277,'@Ascended Raid@The druid raged against our masters, but his rage turned to madness, and his madness became a part of them.','@Ascended Raid@那德鲁伊曾对我们的主人怒吼，但他的愤怒化作了疯狂，而他的疯狂成了他们的一部分。'),
(211326,'@Ascended Raid@In the city of Ny''alotha many thing dream forever. You will join them. All will join them.','@Ascended Raid@在尼奥罗萨之城，许多事物永远沉眠于梦中。你将加入它们。万物都将加入它们。'),
