(218126,'@Ascended Onyxia@\nThe fire that gave this axe its fury has turned to ash. Now it waits, cold and patient, for the one who seeks the elemental''s power.','@Ascended Onyxia@\n赋予这把斧头狂怒的火焰已化为灰烬。如今它寒冷而耐心地等待着，等待寻找元素之力的人。'),
