(218564,'@Ascended Raid@The Right Half of Thunderaan''s Eternal Prison','@Ascended Raid@桑德兰永恒牢笼的右半边'),
(218646,'@Molten Core Ascended@You can see movement when you peer into the Eye.','@Molten Core Ascended@当你凝视这只眼时，能看到其中有东西在动。'),
(218703,'@Ascended Raid@A very large petrified leaf.','@Ascended Raid@一片非常大的石化树叶。'),
(218724,'@Onyxia''s Lair Ascended@An almost indestructible string. Perfect for a mighty bow stave.','@Onyxia''s Lair Ascended@一根几乎无法摧毁的弦。适合制作强大弓身的材料。'),
(218803,'@Ascended Molten Core@Property of Finkle Einhorn, Grandmaster Adventurer','@Ascended Molten Core@芬克尔·艾因霍恩的财产，冒险者宗师'),
(219360,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The Hand of Nefarius','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@奈法利乌斯之手'),
(219364,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The initials A.L. are etched on the hilt.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@剑柄上刻着首字母 A.L.。'),
(219376,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@Such a mortal like yourself shouldn''t harness such power.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@像你这样的凡人不应驾驭这种力量。'),
(219378,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The threading is unlike anything you have ever seen. It appears metallic in origin.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@这线料与你见过的任何东西都不同，看起来源自金属。'),
(219379,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@A silver liquid flows within the impenetrable ebony shell. The item feels pure. It radiates an essence of extreme power.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@银色液体在无法穿透的乌木外壳中流动。这件物品纯净无比，散发着极致力量的气息。'),
(219380,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The metal is warm to the touch. The links connecting the belt together appear to be fashioned out of Elementium.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@金属摸起来是温的。连接腰带的链环似乎由源质制成。'),
(219382,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@Flawless. Indestructible. You cannot comprehend the craftsmanship involved with the creation of this ring.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@完美无瑕。坚不可摧。你无法理解铸造这枚戒指所需的技艺。'),
(219389,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The hides of several different dragon flights appear to be stitched together, comprising the top of the shoulders.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@几种不同龙军团的皮革缝在一起，构成了肩部的上缘。'),
(219390,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@A cold chill passes through your spine as you place your hands on these gloves. They appear to be made from the skin of whelplings - a lot of whelplings.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@当你把手放进这副手套时，一股寒意窜过脊椎。它们似乎是用雏龙的皮做的——很多很多雏龙。'),
(219396,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@The flesh from different dragon flights has been sewn together to make this belt.','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@这条腰带由不同龙军团的皮肉缝合而成。'),
(219433,'@Ascended Blackwing Lair@... Pants on Fire','@Ascended Blackwing Lair@……说谎说得裤子着火'),
