(241486,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The Blood of Drakkisath Flows Within...','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@达基萨斯之血在其体内流淌……'),
(244250,'Call forth your Sunlit Overseer, and let An’she’s radiant gaze light your path. With feathers glinting like dawn, this vigilant guardian watches over your every step.','召唤你的日光监守者，让安舍的光辉凝视照亮你的道路。羽毛如晨光般闪耀，这位警觉的守护者注视着你每一步。'),
(244251,'Summon your Moonlit Overseer to bask in Elune’s gentle glow. With serene wisdom and feathers bright as starlit skies, it guides you through the shadows with unwavering grace.','召唤你的月光监守者，沐浴在艾露恩温柔的辉光中。它以宁静的智慧与如星光般明亮的羽翼，以不变的优雅引领你穿过阴影。'),
(244252,'Equips your Tamed Eboncoil, dark as midnight, who watches from your shoulder—a silent, shadowed companion keeping a vigilant eye on your path.','装备你驯服的乌木盘蛇，它黑如午夜，栖于你的肩头——一位沉默的暗影伙伴，警觉地注视你的道路。'),
(244569,'@Ascended Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Ascended Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(244582,'@Ascended Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Ascended Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(244650,'@Ascended@It''s not actually Malygos''s heart. Rather it''s an object of incredible power that Alexstrasza retrieved from his body.','@Ascended@这其实并不是玛里苟斯的心脏，而是阿莱克丝塔萨从他的躯体中取出的一件蕴含惊人力量的物品。'),
(244651,'@Ascended@A personally signed letter from the Queen''s Consort, granting its bearer the right to claim an item of their choice from the royal treasury.','@Ascended@一封女王配偶亲笔签名的信函，授予持有者从皇家宝库中任选一件物品的权利。'),
(244831,'@Ascended Raid@Nerglish for Dummies','@Ascended Raid@纳迦语入门'),
(244833,'@Mythic@Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Earth Song Falls in inner Maraudon.','@Mythic@创造一个传送门，将使用它的队员传送到玛拉顿深处的“地歌瀑布”。'),
(246201,'@Mythic@What the combat specialist wants, the combat specialist gets... PEWPEWLAWLZ','@Mythic@战斗专家想要什么，战斗专家就能得到……砰砰轰隆哇哈哈'),
