(261631,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This blade is dimensional. It appears to be fading from this plane of existence.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这柄刃锋跨越维度。它似乎正从这个世界上逐渐消散。'),
(261887,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This Transmogrification item is found on the Ethereal Bazaar!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@该幻化物品可在以太集市找到！'),
(265289,'@Mythic@Looks like this is for internal use only.','@Mythic@这看起来仅供内部使用。'),
(267830,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@After a good washing, this mail is serviceable, if a little baggy.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@好好洗过之后，这件锁甲还算能用，只是有点肥大。'),
(267831,'@Mythic@After a good washing, this mail is serviceable, if a little baggy.','@Mythic@好好洗过之后，这件锁甲还算能用，只是有点肥大。'),
(268496,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Not the most attractive of headgear, but it gets the job done. Be sure to escape as quickly as possible after putting it on.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@算不上最好看的头饰，但确实管用。戴上后记得尽快逃离。'),
(268497,'@Mythic@Not the most attractive of headgear, but it gets the job done. Be sure to escape as quickly as possible after putting it on.','@Mythic@算不上最好看的头饰，但确实管用。戴上后记得尽快逃离。'),
(269359,'@Mythic@The inscription reads: Never give them the chance to doubt you.','@Mythic@铭文写着：永远别给他们怀疑你的机会。'),
(269607,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@I''m going to count backwards from three. When I reach zero, you''re going to stop pummeling me... well, that''s the theory.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@我要从三倒数。数到零时，你就会停止揍我……好吧，理论上如此。'),
(269608,'@Mythic@I''m going to count backwards from three. When I reach zero, you''re going to stop pummeling me... well, that''s the theory.','@Mythic@我要从三倒数。数到零时，你就会停止揍我……好吧，理论上如此。'),
(270205,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Worn by affiliates of the Consortium.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@由地精财团成员佩戴。'),
(270206,'@Mythic@Worn by affiliates of the Consortium.','@Mythic@由地精财团成员佩戴。'),
(270515,'@Mythic@A faded engraving reads, ''presented upon graduation from Lonika''s School of Roguery.''','@Mythic@一行褪色的刻字写道：“洛妮卡盗贼学校毕业纪念。”'),
(272891,'@Mythic@They won''t see you coming but they''ll definitely see you leaving.','@Mythic@他们不会看见你来，但一定会看见你离开。'),
(278854,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(280691,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Made from 100% genuine leather.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@100% 真皮制成。'),
