(297270,'@Ascended Raid@An official document, certifying Onyxia''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n  - Overlord Runthak outside of Orgrimmar Bank.\n  - Major Mattingly outside of Trade District in Stormwind.\n  - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Ascended Raid@一份证明奥妮克希亚已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n  - 奥格瑞玛银行外的伦萨克督军。\n  - 暴风城贸易区外的马廷利少校。\n  - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
(297271,'@Ascended Raid@The head of Nefarian: Brood of Deathwing.','@Ascended Raid@奈法利安——死亡之翼血脉的头颅。'),
(297272,'@Ascended@An official document, certifying Nefarian''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n - Thrall in Grommash Hold (Orgrimmar).\n - Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep (Stormwind).\n - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Ascended@一份证明奈法利安已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n - 格罗玛什堡垒的萨尔（奥格瑞玛）。\n - 暴风要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根（暴风城）。\n - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
