(304499,'Teaches you how to summon this companion. \n\n This is a non-combat companion.\n \nThey love wearing their little hats—just not too many in one day. Gotta give them time to strut each look properly.','教你如何召唤此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。\n\n它们喜欢戴自己的小帽子——但一天内别戴太多顶，总得给它们时间好好炫耀每一种造型。'),
(311273,'@Heroic Raid@Aydreath believed himself a noble protector of nature, but he was nothing more than a common beast in the end.','@Heroic Raid@艾德瑞斯自认为是自然的高贵守护者，但到头来他不过是一头寻常野兽。'),
(311275,'@Heroic Raid@You need not see the world around you. Listen only to their voice, and you will destroy it.','@Heroic Raid@你无需看清周遭的世界。只听他们的声音，你就会摧毁它。'),
(311277,'@Heroic Raid@The druid raged against our masters, but his rage turned to madness, and his madness became a part of them.','@Heroic Raid@那德鲁伊曾对我们的主人怒吼，但他的愤怒化作了疯狂，而他的疯狂成了他们的一部分。'),
(311326,'@Heroic Raid@In the city of Ny''alotha many thing dream forever. You will join them. All will join them.','@Heroic Raid@在尼奥罗萨之城，许多事物永远沉眠于梦中。你将加入它们。万物都将加入它们。'),
(311432,'@Heroic Raid@Small engraving on the side implies this belonged to Okuno, the member of Ashtongue.','@Heroic Raid@侧面的小刻字表明这属于灰舌成员奥库诺。'),
(313237,'@Heroic Raid@All that remains of the former Highlord Alexandros Mograine.','@Heroic Raid@前大领主亚历山德罗斯·莫格莱尼仅存的残骸。'),
(314001,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ Such a mortal like yourself shouldn''t harness such power.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 像你这样的凡人不应驾驭这种力量。'),
(314986,'@Heroic Raid@There''s a lot at steak here!','@Heroic Raid@这里可押了不少筹码！'),
(315020,'@Heroic Raid@ A cloak made from the former Lord of Blackrock own scales.','@Heroic Raid@ 用黑石塔前主人的鳞片制成的斗篷。'),
(315028,'@Heroic Raid@This unique watch is distorting time.','@Heroic Raid@这块奇特的怀表正在扭曲时间。'),
(315402,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This Transmogrification item is found on the Ethereal Bazaar!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@该幻化物品可在以太集市找到！'),
(315900,'@Heroic Raid@The ultimate fusion of vibration and cutting technology','@Heroic Raid@振动与切割技术的终极融合'),
(317707,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Gun for the Ethical and Humane Treatment of Animals','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@动物伦理与人道对待协会专用枪'),
(317708,'@Mythic@Gun for the Ethical and Humane Treatment of Animals','@Mythic@动物伦理与人道对待协会专用枪'),
(318126,'@Heroic Onyxia@\nThe fire that gave this axe its fury has turned to ash. Now it waits, cold and patient, for the one who seeks the elemental''s power.','@Heroic Onyxia@\n赋予这把斧头狂怒的火焰已化为灰烬。如今它寒冷而耐心地等待着，等待寻找元素之力的人。'),
(318563,'@Heroic Raid@The Left Half of Thunderaan''s Eternal Prison','@Heroic Raid@桑德兰永恒牢笼的左半边'),
(318564,'@Heroic Raid@The Right Half of Thunderaan''s Eternal Prison','@Heroic Raid@桑德兰永恒牢笼的右半边'),
(318646,'@Molten Core Heroic@You can see movement when you peer into the Eye.','@Molten Core Heroic@当你凝视这只眼时，能看到其中有东西在动。'),
(318724,'@Onyxia''s Lair Heroic@An almost indestructible string. Perfect for a mighty bow stave.','@Onyxia''s Lair Heroic@一根几乎无法摧毁的弦。适合制作强大弓身的材料。'),
(318803,'@Heroic Molten Core@ Property of Finkle Einhorn, Grandmaster Adventurer','@Heroic Molten Core@ 芬克尔·艾因霍恩的财产，冒险者宗师'),
(319360,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The Hand of Nefarius','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 奈法利乌斯之手'),
(319364,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The initials A.L. are etched on the hilt.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 剑柄上刻着首字母 A.L.。'),
(319376,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ Such a mortal like yourself shouldn''t harness such power.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 像你这样的凡人不应驾驭这种力量。'),
(319378,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The threading is unlike anything you have ever seen. It appears metallic in origin.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 这线料与你见过的任何东西都不同，看起来源自金属。'),
(319379,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ A silver liquid flows within the impenetrable ebony shell. The item feels pure. It radiates an essence of extreme power.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 银色液体在无法穿透的乌木外壳中流动。这件物品纯净无比，散发着极致力量的气息。'),
(319380,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The metal is warm to the touch. The links connecting the belt together appear to be fashioned out of Elementium.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 金属摸起来是温的。连接腰带的链环似乎由源质制成。'),
(319382,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ Flawless. Indestructible. You cannot comprehend the craftsmanship involved with the creation of this ring.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 完美无瑕。坚不可摧。你无法理解铸造这枚戒指所需的技艺。'),
(319389,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The hides of several different dragon flights appear to be stitched together, comprising the top of the shoulders.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 几种不同龙军团的皮革缝在一起，构成了肩部的上缘。'),
(319390,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ A cold chill passes through your spine as you place your hands on these gloves. They appear to be made from the skin of whelplings - a lot of whelplings.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 当你把手放进这副手套时，一股寒意窜过脊椎。它们似乎是用雏龙的皮做的——很多很多雏龙。'),
(319396,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ The flesh from different dragon flights has been sewn together to make this belt.','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ 这条腰带由不同龙军团的皮肉缝合而成。'),
(319433,'@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ ... Pants on Fire','@Heroic Blackwing Lair@ ……说谎说得裤子着火'),
(319866,'@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ The seething flames of hatred.','@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ 翻腾的憎恨之焰。'),
(319900,'@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ Bears the mark of Jin.','@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ 带有金的印记。'),
(319901,'@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ Also serves as a skinning knife.','@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ 也可作为剥皮小刀使用。'),
(319944,'@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ The inscription reads: Fishin''s fer sissies -Nat Pagle','@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ 铭文写着：钓鱼是娘们干的 ——纳特·帕格'),
(319947,'@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ The inscription reads: Fer really long castin''.','@Heroic Zul''Gurub@ 铭文写着：超～长～读～条。'),
(320563,'Probably should’ve stopped, dropped, and rolled...','大概该停下来、趴下、打滚的……'),
