(339221,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Not at all','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@一点也不'),
(339222,'@Mythic@Not at all','@Mythic@一点也不'),
(339663,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@One is enough if it''s big','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@只要够大，一个就够'),
(339664,'@Mythic@One is enough if it''s big','@Mythic@只要够大，一个就够'),
(339755,'@Heroic Raid@ A proud fighter displays the ears of those he has slain in battle.','@Heroic Raid@ 一位骄傲的战士炫耀着他在战斗中所杀之敌的耳朵。'),
(342027,'@Mythic@Everything from silvered knives to holy water.','@Mythic@从镀银小刀到圣水，应有尽有。'),
(343326,'@Mythic@A crusading knight will always heed this blessed horn''s clarion call.','@Mythic@十字军骑士永远会响应这祝福号角的嘹亮号令。'),
(344354,'@Mythic@A blessed tome filled with the words of the Argent''s Dawn''s wisest.','@Mythic@一本蒙福的书卷，记载着银色黎明最睿智者的箴言。'),
(344569,'@Heroic Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Heroic Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(344582,'@Heroic Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Heroic Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(344650,'@Heroic@It''s not actually Malygos''s heart. Rather it''s an object of incredible power that Alexstrasza retrieved from his body.','@Heroic@这其实并不是玛里苟斯的心脏，而是阿莱克丝塔萨从他的躯体中取出的一件蕴含惊人力量的物品。'),
(344651,'@Heroic@A personally signed letter from the Queen''s Consort, granting its bearer the right to claim an item of their choice from the royal treasury.','@Heroic@一封女王配偶亲笔签名的信函，授予持有者从皇家宝库中任选一件物品的权利。'),
(344831,'@Heroic Raid@ Nerglish for Dummies','@Heroic Raid@ 纳迦语入门'),
(347166,'@Heroic Raid@Don''t touch what you can''t afford.','@Heroic Raid@别碰你买不起的东西。'),
(351467,'@Mythic@Guaranteed to extinguish the fire, and everything else.','@Mythic@保证能灭火——以及其它一切。'),
(354099,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(354119,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(354186,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(354199,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(354215,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(354218,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(354231,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(354236,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(354246,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(354250,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(354253,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(354259,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(354260,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(354266,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(354269,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(354275,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(354279,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(354280,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(354447,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(354448,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(354450,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(354453,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(354454,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(354455,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(354457,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(354458,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(354459,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(354461,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(354462,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(354464,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
