(397270,'@Heroic Raid@ An official document, certifying Onyxia''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n  - Overlord Runthak outside of Orgrimmar Bank.\n  - Major Mattingly outside of Trade District in Stormwind.\n  - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Heroic Raid@ 一份证明奥妮克希亚已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n  - 奥格瑞玛银行外的伦萨克督军。\n  - 暴风城贸易区外的马廷利少校。\n  - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
(397318,'@|cffff0000Bronzebeard realm is now freely accessible to everyone.@This item is now a limited edition collectible that was once used by Founders to grant access to the Alpha of the Original 9 Classes - Bronzebeard Realm before the server release.','@|cffff0000铜须服务器现已向所有人免费开放。@此物品现为限量收藏品，曾由创始人用于在服务器发布前授予原初九职业 Alpha 测试资格——铜须服务器。'),
(400750,'@Classic@Obtained in Classic Raids. Allows you to purchase gear from Romus the Redeemer, found in capital cities. Guards can give you directions to Romus.','@Classic@可在经典团队副本中获得。允许你向各大主城的救赎者罗穆斯购买装备。卫兵可以为你指路。'),
(400751,'@The Burning Crusade@Obtained through conquering Outland''s fiercest creatures.','@The Burning Crusade@通过征服外域最凶猛的生物获得。'),
(410015,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(410016,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(410085,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(410101,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(410145,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(410160,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(415026,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(415040,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(415049,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(415054,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(415058,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(415059,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(415060,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(415065,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(415093,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(415140,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(415146,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(415151,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(415160,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(424091,'@Mythic@It has the power... to move you.','@Mythic@它拥有……打动人心的力量。'),
(424359,'@Mythic@These leggings will guide you to the princely reign.','@Mythic@这条护腿将引领你走向王者之治。'),
(427427,'@Mythic@This is a legacy chest piece worn by Frostwolf chieftans for eleven generations.','@Mythic@这是霜狼酋长们传承了十一代的胸甲。'),
(427840,'@Mythic@Stolen long ago by the Nexus-Kings, the Scepter embodies the righteous power of the Naaru.','@Mythic@很久以前被枢纽之王们窃取，这根权杖承载着纳鲁的正义之力。'),
(428774,'@Ascended Raid@The weapon of the Pit Lord Magtheridon. The demonic power inherited within the glaive faded with the Pit Lord''s death.','@Ascended Raid@深渊领主玛瑟里顿的武器。战刃中继承的恶魔之力随深渊领主的死亡而消散。'),
(428775,'@Ascended Raid@The weapon of the Pit Lord Magtheridon. The demonic power inherited within the glaive faded with the Pit Lord''s death.','@Ascended Raid@深渊领主玛瑟里顿的武器。战刃中继承的恶魔之力随深渊领主的死亡而消散。'),
(428776,'@Ascended Raid@The weapon of the Pit Lord Magtheridon. The demonic power inherited within the glaive faded with the Pit Lord''s death.','@Ascended Raid@深渊领主玛瑟里顿的武器。战刃中继承的恶魔之力随深渊领主的死亡而消散。'),
