(450003,'@Heroic Raid@ The vial is still intact, containing a small amount of the water from the Well of Eternity.','@Heroic Raid@ 小瓶仍完好无损，里面装着少量永恒之井的水。'),
(450004,'@Ascended Raid@The vial is still intact, containing a small amount of the water from the Well of Eternity.','@Ascended Raid@小瓶仍完好无损，里面装着少量永恒之井的水。'),
(450005,'@Ascended Raid@The vial is still intact, containing a small amount of the water from the Well of Eternity.','@Ascended Raid@小瓶仍完好无损，里面装着少量永恒之井的水。'),
(450007,'@Heroic Raid@ The warglaive lost all its power with its masters death. Combine the glaive with a Intact Vial of Lady Vashj or Kael''thas Sunstrider to restore its power.','@Heroic Raid@ 战刃随主人的死亡失去了全部力量。将战刃与瓦丝琪女士或凯尔萨斯·逐日者的完好的小瓶组合，即可恢复它的力量。'),
(450008,'@Ascended Raid@The warglaive lost all its power with its masters death. Combine the glaive with a Intact Vial of Lady Vashj or Kael''thas Sunstrider to restore its power.','@Ascended Raid@战刃随主人的死亡失去了全部力量。将战刃与瓦丝琪女士或凯尔萨斯·逐日者的完好的小瓶组合，即可恢复它的力量。'),
(450011,'@Heroic Raid@The string appears to flicker, shifting between different states of time.','@Heroic Raid@这根弦似乎在闪烁，在不同时间状态间变换。'),
(450012,'@Heroic Raid@Its missing a sinew. Combine the frame with The String of Time to restore Thori''dal, the Stars'' Fury.','@Heroic Raid@它缺了一根肌腱。将框架与时光之弦组合，即可复原索利达尔，群星之怒。'),
(450013,'@Mythic Raid@The string appears to flicker, shifting between different states of time.','@Mythic Raid@这根弦似乎在闪烁，在不同时间状态间变换。'),
(450014,'@Mythic Raid@Its missing a sinew. Combine the frame with The String of Time to restore Thori''dal, the Stars'' Fury.','@Mythic Raid@它缺了一根肌腱。将框架与时光之弦组合，即可复原索利达尔，群星之怒。'),
(450015,'@Ascended Raid@The string appears to flicker, shifting between different states of time.','@Ascended Raid@这根弦似乎在闪烁，在不同时间状态间变换。'),
(450016,'@Ascended Raid@Its missing a sinew. Combine the frame with The String of Time to restore Thori''dal, the Stars'' Fury.','@Ascended Raid@它缺了一根肌腱。将框架与时光之弦组合，即可复原索利达尔，群星之怒。'),
(450263,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(450500,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(450512,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(450515,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(450525,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(450526,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(450528,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(450540,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(450551,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(450552,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(450614,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(450616,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(450623,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(450624,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(450634,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(450644,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(450652,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(450653,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(450654,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(450807,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(450809,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(450871,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(451046,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
