(497272,'@Mythic@An official document, certifying Nefarian''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n - Thrall in Grommash Hold (Orgrimmar).\n - Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep (Stormwind).\n - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Mythic@一份证明奈法利安已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n - 格罗玛什堡垒的萨尔（奥格瑞玛）。\n - 暴风要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根（暴风城）。\n - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
