(515031,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(515037,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(515039,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(515046,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(515047,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(515146,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(515150,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(515183,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(515207,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(515208,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(515216,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(515222,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(515223,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(515238,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(515243,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(515249,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(515251,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(515273,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(515284,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(515286,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(515292,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(515296,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(515305,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(515306,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(515323,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(515354,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(515365,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(515502,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(515525,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(515531,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(515536,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(515540,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(515603,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(515604,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(515608,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(515610,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(515612,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(515614,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(515621,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(515624,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(515628,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(515629,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(515634,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(515676,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(515681,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(515720,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(515732,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(515733,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(515737,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(515749,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(515767,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(515791,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(515827,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(521069,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(521105,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(531479,'@Mythic 11@Once worn by a cleric of Karabor, this item allows the wearer entry into the Black Temple.','@Mythic 11@曾由卡拉波尔的牧师佩戴，此物可让佩戴者进入黑暗神殿。'),
