(558516,'Impossible to miss a juggling throw with this magic torch, as long as you have hands to hold it—or your mouth!','用这把魔法火炬抛接绝不会失手，只要你有手握着它——或者用嘴也行！'),
(558517,'The foam reflects the quality of the beer—an exclusive special edition of Aldara''s brew, made just for the Azzar Faire.','泡沫映出啤酒的品质——这是阿尔达拉酿造工坊专为阿扎尔集市打造的独家特酿。'),
(558522,'Sample of soil tainted by the evil slumbering beneath the island. Yth’qwa’s corruption seeps slowly to the surface, whispering malevolence. Sleep is elusive amidst the clamor wrought by the goblins.','一份被岛下沉睡邪物污染的土壤样本。伊斯克瓦的腐化正缓慢渗至地表，低语着恶意。在其喧嚣之中，睡眠实属奢望。'),
(558543,'A powerful coffee capable of bringing the dead back to life; it must contain something magical. It’s also great for curing even the worst hangovers.','一种能把死者唤回的强效咖啡，它一定含有某种魔法成分。它也能治好最严重的宿醉。'),
(558861,'A fading mana shard, extracted from a surprisingly friendly mana wyrm in Quel’Thalas. Despite its affectionate nature, it met the same fate as the others.','一块逐渐黯淡的法力碎片，取自奎尔萨拉斯一只出奇友善的法力游蛇。尽管它性情亲昵，终究还是落得与其他同类相同的下场。'),
(558960,'<The potion is unfinished. A note stuck to the side lists the ingredients Dulcinea has already bought—neatly crossed off—and the ones still to purchase: Elgris blossom petals, Dun Kazad liquor concentrate, pumpkin juice, and a murloc eyeball.>','<药水尚未完成。贴在侧面的一张便条列着杜尔西内娅已购得的材料——已整齐划掉——以及尚需购买的：艾尔格里斯花瓣、敦卡扎德烈酒浓缩液、南瓜汁，还有一颗鱼人眼球。>'),
(559010,'Among the fake coins, a few genuine ones slip in—just enough to make even the sharpest eye hesitate.','假币之中混进了几枚真币——足以让最锐利的眼睛也犹豫片刻。'),
(559043,'A record of unpaid bets and loans. Most of the names are crossed out—probably not because they paid their debts.','一份未还赌债与借款的记录。大多数名字被划掉了——大概不是因为他们还了钱。'),
(559070,'A thick piece of paper folded in half. You don’t know how it ended up in your pockets.','一张对折的厚纸。你不知道它怎么跑到你口袋里来的。'),
(559071,'Map of Stormwind’s docks and its surroundings, angrily scribbled. The author of the drawing had an unsteady hand. Even so, the high level of detail suggests they had been infiltrating the city for a long time.','暴风城码头及周边区域的地图，笔触愤怒潦草。绘图者手很不稳。即便如此，极高的细节程度表明他们已潜入该城很长时间。'),
(559081,'Anyone would be wary of the liquid inside, but you can tell there’s something magical about the potion.','任何人都会对里面的液体保持警惕，但你能看出这瓶药水有些魔法之处。'),
(559096,'Small cockroach bits stuck to your boots — crunchy, but still a bit moist.','靴子上粘着些蟑螂碎屑——脆生生的，但还有点潮。'),
(559138,'A splintered fragment of a larger key. When Priscilla Cain fled the family estate during the Scourge invasion, her maids and servants, with no other refuge, barricaded themselves inside the mansion. Soon, however, they realized the monsters outside were no more dangerous than the ones Priscilla had birthed within. And so they sealed the cellar… and shattered the key into three pieces.','一把更大钥匙的碎裂残片。天灾入侵期间普莉希拉·凯恩逃离家族庄园时，她的女仆与仆人们无处可去，便将自己封在宅邸内。然而很快他们就意识到，外面的怪物并不比普莉希拉在宅内孕育的那些更危险。于是他们封死了地窖……并把钥匙碎成三段。'),
(559139,'A splintered fragment of a larger key. When Priscilla Cain fled the family estate during the Scourge invasion, her maids and servants, with no other refuge, barricaded themselves inside the mansion. Soon, however, they realized the monsters outside were no more dangerous than the ones Priscilla had birthed within. And so they sealed the cellar… and shattered the key into three pieces.','一把更大钥匙的碎裂残片。天灾入侵期间普莉希拉·凯恩逃离家族庄园时，她的女仆与仆人们无处可去，便将自己封在宅邸内。然而很快他们就意识到，外面的怪物并不比普莉希拉在宅内孕育的那些更危险。于是他们封死了地窖……并把钥匙碎成三段。'),
(559140,'A splintered fragment of a larger key. When Priscilla Cain fled the family estate during the Scourge invasion, her maids and servants, with no other refuge, barricaded themselves inside the mansion. Soon, however, they realized the monsters outside were no more dangerous than the ones Priscilla had birthed within. And so they sealed the cellar… and shattered the key into three pieces.','一把更大钥匙的碎裂残片。天灾入侵期间普莉希拉·凯恩逃离家族庄园时，她的女仆与仆人们无处可去，便将自己封在宅邸内。然而很快他们就意识到，外面的怪物并不比普莉希拉在宅内孕育的那些更危险。于是他们封死了地窖……并把钥匙碎成三段。'),
(559141,'<The fragments have been reforged into a single, jagged key. Its weight carries the memory of those who sealed the horrors below… and the dread of what you may now unleash.>','<碎片已被重铸成一把带锯齿的钥匙。它的重量承载着封住地下恐怖之人的记忆……也承载着你此刻可能释放之物的恐惧。>'),
(559146,'A bone amulet set with a blood-red gem. This and other such stones were unearthed by the Darkspear trolls when they uncovered the colossal ruins of a troll civilization far older than their tribe. The two massive stone columns looming over the Valley of Trials stand as a bitter reminder of the trolls’ lost greatness… and how far they have fallen since.','一枚镶着血红宝石的骨制护符。这枚宝石与其它同类石块，是暗矛巨魔在发现远比其部族古老的巨魔文明废墟时挖出的。俯瞰试炼谷的两根巨大石柱，正是巨魔失落荣光……以及他们自那以后衰落之深的苦涩提醒。'),
(559148,'Spiritual essence of a bat, symbol of Hir’eek. To some, the Bat Loa embodies night and secrets. To others, thirst and blood.','蝙蝠的灵魂精华，希尔里克的象征。对某些人而言，蝙蝠洛阿代表着夜晚与秘密；对另一些人，则意味着饥渴与鲜血。'),
(559157,'Ring of Morriga Hollowhoof, daughter of the Three Totems tyrant. The set gem proclaims its bearer beyond doubt—a wielder of dark sorcery','三图腾暴君之女莫瑞加·空蹄的戒指。镶嵌的宝石无疑昭示佩戴者的身份——一位黑暗巫术的使用者'),
(559161,'A ramshackle contraption of questionable use. It only vaguely resembles a rifle—its warped, stretched barrel ending in something like a funnel.','一台用途可疑的破旧装置。它只是隐约像把步枪——扭曲拉长的枪管末端像个漏斗。'),
(559165,'A gleaming jewel, long reduced to the role of a paperweight. The ghouls roaming the manor’s halls must have stumbled over it more than once, blind to its worth.','一颗曾闪亮如今只配当镇纸的宝石。游荡在宅邸走廊里的食尸鬼想必不止一次被它绊到，却浑然不知它的价值。'),
(559166,'An arcane relic you might expect to find at a cheap carnival stall. This one, however, despite its shabby look, pulses with a will of its own. Like a seashell holding the ocean’s echo, this crystal sphere whispers to the mind that dares to listen.','一件你或许会在廉价嘉年华摊位上看到的奥术遗物。然而这一件尽管外表破旧，却脉动着属于自己的意志。如同海螺封存着海洋的回声，这颗水晶球向敢于倾听的心智低语。'),
(559167,'A Cain family signet, one among the many baubles that once adorned the fingers, necks, and ears of the household’s women. It seems a maid tried to flee with this one in particular, leaping out onto the roof. But the ghoul was faster.','一枚凯恩家族印戒，是曾经点缀家中女眷手指、颈项与耳垂的众多饰物之一。看来有名女仆曾试图带着这一枚逃走，跳上了屋顶。但食尸鬼更快。'),
(559586,'Teaches you how to summon a Jumper’s Pedestal.','教你如何召唤跳跃者基座。'),
(560003,'Membranous scrap from the only, and saddest, shroud Priscilla’s child ever knew. With twisted fingers, he clutched this rag of flesh through the long, hollow nights of his solitude.','来自普莉希拉之子所知的唯一、也最悲惨的襁褓的残余组织。在漫长而空虚的孤独之夜，他用扭曲的手指紧攥着这块血肉残片。'),
(560004,'A tiny droplet of liquid radiation. This water elemental was but one of many creatures touched by the radiance worshipped by the zealots of Radiance Town. The Sicklight’s Children unleash countless more like it throughout their lands, set as watchful guardians.','一小滴液态辐射。这只水元素只是众多被光辉镇狂信徒所崇拜之光触碰过的生物之一。病光之子们在其土地上释放着无数同类，作为警备的守护者。'),
(560011,'Phosphorescent fang of His Radiant Majesty’s companion; the first among his followers. They were the only ones to ever cross paths with the fearsome god of radiation revered by the Sicklight’s Children.','光辉陛下伙伴的磷光獠牙，它是其信徒中的第一位。它们是唯一与病光信徒所敬拜的可怕辐射之神正面相遇过的存在。'),
(560012,'Weathered collar, stained with old blood, once belonging to the Cain family’s hound. The lord of the house would hunt the Whispering Forest alongside him, until the day they met a black goat with wakeful eyes. The lord never set foot in that forest again.','一条风化的项圈，沾着陈旧的血迹，曾属于该隐家族的猎犬。庄园之主常与它一同在低语森林狩猎，直到有一天他们遇见了那只眼神清醒的黑山羊。此后，庄园之主再未踏入那片森林。'),
