(627941,'Warm to the touch and rumored to make your lies sound like truth. The previous owner talked his way into—and never out of—Ragnaros''s inner chamber.','触感温热，据说能让你的谎言听起来像真话。它的前任主人一路谈进了拉格纳罗斯的内室——再也没能谈出来。'),
(629965,'Don’t ask how I smuggled this out of Ironforge. Dwarves guard their grooming gear like treasure. \n\nStill sharp enough to shave stone or carve your way through awkward negotiations.','别问我怎么把它从铁炉堡偷出来的。矮人守护他们的梳理工具如同守护宝藏。\n\n它仍然锋利得足以刮石头，或为你劈开尴尬的谈判。'),
(629968,'Limited edition Only fifty thousand made. I got this one from a grumpy ogre who drinks molten butter. \n\nHolds liquids, dreams, and disappointment. Handle’s only mostly cracked.','限量版，仅制作五万件。这是我从一个喝熔融黄油的暴躁食人魔那里弄来的。\n\n可以盛液体、盛梦想，也盛失望。勉强还能用，把手只是“大部分”裂了。'),
