(699810,'@Ascended Raid@Countless lives have ceased to exist from the wrath of this blade. It''s name Amarth is an Elvish word meaning Doom, very fitting for a blade that has ended so many!','@Ascended Raid@已有无数生命因这柄剑的狂怒而消逝。它名为“阿玛斯”，在精灵语中意为“末日”，对这柄终结了如此多生命的剑来说再合适不过！'),
