(824378,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(824385,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(824387,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(824393,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(824396,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(824400,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(853250,'@Mythic 21@This ring was empowered by the princess of the blue dragonflight.','@Mythic 21@这枚戒指曾被蓝龙军团的公主灌注力量。'),
