(898071,'@s:984315:2@Unroll a sleeping rug. Napping on it for atleast one minute will provide a bonus to experience earned. For a Nap? It will just be fine.. I think..\n\n3 hour cooldown.','@s:984315:2@摊开一张睡毯。在上面小睡至少一分钟，即可获得经验值加成。只是打个盹？应该也没事……我想。\n\n3 小时冷却。'),
(898072,'@s:984317:1@Bring Christmas cheer all year round!\n\nWarning: While generally reliable, the portable Wondervolt occasionally experiences size calibration errors.\n\n30min cooldown.','@s:984317:1@全年带来圣诞欢乐！\n\n警告：虽然通常可靠，便携式奇妙电击器偶尔会出现尺寸校准错误。\n\n冷却时间 30 分钟。'),
(900027,'@Ascended Raid@Even longer than your average cloak or cape.','@Ascended Raid@比你一般的斗篷或披风还要长。'),
