(1029571,'It''s been 17 days since the blasted beast stormed me camp, snatched me up like a keg o’ ale, and hauled me off to his stinkin’ cave. \n\nThought I’d be dinner, but the great lizard just drops meat at me feet and watches. Every time I try to leave he goes all ferocious and mean… like I’m some pet or prisoner. \n\nEither way, I ain''t sharin’ me ale with ‘im and I''ll get back to me darling Susy.','那头该死的野兽冲进我的营地、像拎酒桶一样把我抓走、拖进他那臭气熏天的洞穴，已经 17 天了。\n\n我以为自己会成晚餐，可这大蜥蜴只是把肉丢在我脚边盯着看。每次我想走，他就变得凶暴狠厉……好像我是什么宠物或囚犯。\n\n不管怎样，我才不跟他分享我的麦酒，我还要回到我心爱的苏西身边。'),
(1029572,'They’re coming. Another wave climbing the hill, same as the last. Everyone else is gone. I’m the last one standing... barely. My blade’s chipped to nothing. My arm won’t lift it. It’s better this ends by my hand than theirs. What they do to the living... I’d rather not remain to find out.\n\n - Bhaltair','它们来了。又一批爬上山坡，和上一批一样。其他人都走了，只剩我还站着……勉强罢了。我的刀刃已崩得不成样子，手臂也抬不起它了。与其死在它们手里，不如由我自己了结。它们对活人做的那些事……我可不想留下来亲眼看到。\n\n - 巴尔泰尔'),
