(1065025,'@Mythic 10@Allows you to purchase gear from the Hunter, Mage, and Warlock armor collections.','@Mythic 10@允许你从猎人、法师和术士的护甲合集中购买装备。'),
(1065855,'@Ascended 10@An official document, certifying the Nefarian''s death.','@Ascended 10@一份证明奈法利安已死的官方文件。'),
(1065969,'@Mythic 10@It has the power... to move you.','@Mythic 10@它拥有……打动人心的力量。'),
(1065978,'@Mythic 10@These leggings will guide you to the princely reign.','@Mythic 10@这条护腿将引领你走向王者之治。'),
(1066756,'@Mythic 10@This is a legacy chest piece worn by Frostwolf chieftans for eleven generations.','@Mythic 10@这是霜狼酋长们传承了十一代的胸甲。'),
(1066931,'@Mythic 10@Stolen long ago by the Nexus-Kings, the Scepter embodies the righteous power of the Naaru.','@Mythic 10@很久以前被枢纽之王们窃取，这根权杖承载着纳鲁的正义之力。'),
(1067151,'@Mythic 10@The weapon of the Pit Lord Magtheridon. The demonic power inherited within the glaive faded with the Pit Lord''s death.','@Mythic 10@深渊领主玛瑟里顿的武器。战刃中继承的恶魔之力随深渊领主的死亡而消散。'),
