(1067185,'@Mythic 10@This ring was empowered by the princess of the blue dragonflight.','@Mythic 10@这枚戒指曾被蓝龙军团的公主灌注力量。'),
(1067193,'@Mythic 10@Forged in the heart of a dying star, this ethereal blade is feared across the cosmos.','@Mythic 10@在垂死之星的核心锻造而成，这柄虚灵之刃令整个宇宙为之恐惧。'),
(1067339,'@Mythic 10@This staff has the power to heal all within range.','@Mythic 10@这柄法杖能治疗范围内所有目标。'),
(1067340,'@Mythic 10@At the break of the Winter Solistice, when Santacow came in the. . . dead of night . . .','@Mythic 10@冬至破晓之时，桑塔牛于……死寂之夜降临……'),
