(1180489,'@Do Not Give To Players@\nObtained from sealed card packs at Silas Darkmoon!\n\nUsing this Skill Card will unlock it in your Skill Card Collection. Your Skill Card Collection is shared with all characters on the realm, and you can activate skill cards in the Skill Card Collection menu.\n\nYou must be between level 1 and 9 to use this item. Felforged must be level 20 to use this item.','@Do Not Give To Players@\n可在暗月马戏团的赛拉斯处通过密封卡包获得！\n\n使用这张技能卡会在你的技能卡收藏中解锁它。你的技能卡收藏与本服所有角色共享，可在技能卡收藏菜单中激活技能卡。\n\n你必须处于 1 至 9 级才能使用此物品。邪铸者需达到 20 级才能使用此物品。'),
(1180490,'@Do Not Give To Players@\nObtained from sealed card packs at Silas Darkmoon!\n\nUsing this Skill Card will unlock it in your Skill Card Collection. Your Skill Card Collection is shared with all characters on the realm, and you can activate skill cards in the Skill Card Collection menu.\n\nYou must be between level 1 and 9 to use this item. Felforged must be level 20 to use this item.','@Do Not Give To Players@\n可在暗月马戏团的赛拉斯处通过密封卡包获得！\n\n使用这张技能卡会在你的技能卡收藏中解锁它。你的技能卡收藏与本服所有角色共享，可在技能卡收藏菜单中激活技能卡。\n\n你必须处于 1 至 9 级才能使用此物品。邪铸者需达到 20 级才能使用此物品。'),
