(1287304,'@Classic@Requires max level to open and contains:\n - Gear selectable from your stat type.','@Classic@需满级才能开启，内含：\n - 可按你的属性类型选择的装备。'),
(1287305,'@Classic@Requires max level to open and contains:\n - A chance of one or more global tier tokens, if tiers are released.\n - 4 to 6 equipment pieces from current tier raids or dungeons.\n - One Legendary Enchant for the class of your choice.','@Classic@需满级才能开启，内含：\n - 若已开放团队阶位，有几率获得一或多枚通用团队代币。\n - 4 至 6 件来自当前阶位团队副本或地下城的装备。\n - 一份你自选职业的传说附魔。'),
