(1311273,'@Mythic Raid@Aydreath believed himself a noble protector of nature, but he was nothing more than a common beast in the end.','@Mythic Raid@艾德瑞斯自认为是自然的高贵守护者，但到头来他不过是一头寻常野兽。'),
(1311275,'@Mythic Raid@You need not see the world around you. Listen only to their voice, and you will destroy it.','@Mythic Raid@你无需看清周遭的世界。只听他们的声音，你就会摧毁它。'),
(1311277,'@Mythic Raid@The druid raged against our masters, but his rage turned to madness, and his madness became a part of them.','@Mythic Raid@那德鲁伊曾对我们的主人怒吼，但他的愤怒化作了疯狂，而他的疯狂成了他们的一部分。'),
(1311326,'@Mythic Raid@In the city of Ny''alotha many thing dream forever. You will join them. All will join them.','@Mythic Raid@在尼奥罗萨之城，许多事物永远沉眠于梦中。你将加入它们。万物都将加入它们。'),
(1311432,'@Mythic Raid@Small engraving on the side implies this belonged to Okuno, the member of Ashtongue.','@Mythic Raid@侧面的小刻字表明这属于灰舌成员奥库诺。'),
(1313237,'@Mythic Raid@All that remains of the former Highlord Alexandros Mograine.','@Mythic Raid@前大领主亚历山德罗斯·莫格莱尼仅存的残骸。'),
(1314001,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@Such a mortal like yourself shouldn''t harness such power.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@像你这样的凡人不应驾驭这种力量。'),
(1314986,'@Mythic Raid@There''s a lot at steak here!','@Mythic Raid@这里可押了不少筹码！'),
(1315020,'@Mythic Raid@A cloak made from the former Lord of Blackrock own scales.','@Mythic Raid@用黑石塔前主人的鳞片制成的斗篷。'),
(1315028,'@Mythic Raid@This unique watch is distorting time.','@Mythic Raid@这块奇特的怀表正在扭曲时间。'),
(1315900,'@Mythic Raid@The ultimate fusion of vibration and cutting technology','@Mythic Raid@振动与切割技术的终极融合'),
(1318126,'@Mythic Onyxia@\nThe fire that gave this axe its fury has turned to ash. Now it waits, cold and patient, for the one who seeks the elemental''s power.','@Mythic Onyxia@\n赋予这把斧头狂怒的火焰已化为灰烬。如今它寒冷而耐心地等待着，等待寻找元素之力的人。'),
(1318563,'@Mythic Raid@The Left Half of Thunderaan''s Eternal Prison','@Mythic Raid@桑德兰永恒牢笼的左半边'),
(1318564,'@Mythic Raid@The Right Half of Thunderaan''s Eternal Prison','@Mythic Raid@桑德兰永恒牢笼的右半边'),
(1318646,'@Molten Core Mythic@You can see movement when you peer into the Eye.','@Molten Core Mythic@当你凝视这只眼时，能看到其中有东西在动。'),
(1318724,'@Onyxia''s Lair Mythic@An almost indestructible string. Perfect for a mighty bow stave.','@Onyxia''s Lair Mythic@一根几乎无法摧毁的弦。适合制作强大弓身的材料。'),
(1318803,'@Mythic Molten Core@Property of Finkle Einhorn, Grandmaster Adventurer','@Mythic Molten Core@芬克尔·艾因霍恩的财产，冒险者宗师'),
(1319003,'@Mythic Raid@The head of Nefarian: Brood of Deathwing.','@Mythic Raid@奈法利安——死亡之翼血脉的头颅。'),
(1319360,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The Hand of Nefarius','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@奈法利乌斯之手'),
(1319364,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The initials A.L. are etched on the hilt.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@剑柄上刻着首字母 A.L.。'),
(1319376,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@Such a mortal like yourself shouldn''t harness such power.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@像你这样的凡人不应驾驭这种力量。'),
(1319378,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The threading is unlike anything you have ever seen. It appears metallic in origin.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@这线料与你见过的任何东西都不同，看起来源自金属。'),
(1319379,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@A silver liquid flows within the impenetrable ebony shell. The item feels pure. It radiates an essence of extreme power.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@银色液体在无法穿透的乌木外壳中流动。这件物品纯净无比，散发着极致力量的气息。'),
(1319380,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The metal is warm to the touch. The links connecting the belt together appear to be fashioned out of Elementium.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@金属摸起来是温的。连接腰带的链环似乎由源质制成。'),
(1319382,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@Flawless. Indestructible. You cannot comprehend the craftsmanship involved with the creation of this ring.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@完美无瑕。坚不可摧。你无法理解铸造这枚戒指所需的技艺。'),
(1319389,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The hides of several different dragon flights appear to be stitched together, comprising the top of the shoulders.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@几种不同龙军团的皮革缝在一起，构成了肩部的上缘。'),
(1319390,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@A cold chill passes through your spine as you place your hands on these gloves. They appear to be made from the skin of whelplings - a lot of whelplings.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@当你把手放进这副手套时，一股寒意窜过脊椎。它们似乎是用雏龙的皮做的——很多很多雏龙。'),
(1319396,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@The flesh from different dragon flights has been sewn together to make this belt.','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@这条腰带由不同龙军团的皮肉缝合而成。'),
(1319433,'@Mythic Blackwing Lair@... Pants on Fire','@Mythic Blackwing Lair@……说谎说得裤子着火'),
(1319866,'@Mythic Zul''Gurub@The seething flames of hatred.','@Mythic Zul''Gurub@翻腾的憎恨之焰。'),
(1319900,'@Mythic Zul''Gurub@Bears the mark of Jin.','@Mythic Zul''Gurub@带有金的印记。'),
(1319901,'@Mythic Zul''Gurub@Also serves as a skinning knife.','@Mythic Zul''Gurub@也可作为剥皮小刀使用。'),
(1319944,'@Mythic Zul''Gurub@The inscription reads: Fishin''s fer sissies -Nat Pagle','@Mythic Zul''Gurub@铭文写着：钓鱼是娘们干的 ——纳特·帕格'),
(1319947,'@Mythic Zul''Gurub@The inscription reads: Fer really long castin''.','@Mythic Zul''Gurub@铭文写着：超～长～读～条。'),
