(1330249,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 5 Shoulder Slot items. You may Turn this into any Tier 5 Vendor found within the Scryer or Aldor Tier in Shattrath.','@Mythic Raid@这是第 5 阶肩部部位物品的通用代币。可在沙塔斯城的占星者或奥尔多区域将其交给任意第 5 阶商人。'),
(1330879,'@Mythic Raid@Heavier than it appears, this belt jingles ever so slightly','@Mythic Raid@比看上去更沉，这条腰带会轻轻作响'),
(1331089,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Chest Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in the Caverns of Time (Hyjal Summit).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶胸甲部位物品的通用代币。可在时光之穴（海加尔山）的商人处兑换。'),
(1331092,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Gloves Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in the Caverns of Time (Hyjal Summit).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶手套部位物品的通用代币。可在时光之穴（海加尔山）的商人处兑换。'),
(1331097,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Head Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in the Caverns of Time (Hyjal Summit).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶头部部位物品的通用代币。可在时光之穴（海加尔山）的商人处兑换。'),
(1331098,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Leg Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in the Caverns of Time (Hyjal Summit).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶腿部部位物品的通用代币。可在时光之穴（海加尔山）的商人处兑换。'),
(1331101,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Shoulder Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in the Caverns of Time (Hyjal Summit).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶肩部部位物品的通用代币。可在时光之穴（海加尔山）的商人处兑换。'),
(1332385,'@Mythic Raid@All that remains of the hellspawn, Magtheridon.','@Mythic Raid@地狱之子玛瑟里顿仅剩的残骸。'),
(1332405,'@Mythic Raid@A magical sphere belonging to the lord of the blood elves.','@Mythic Raid@属于血精灵领主的一颗魔法宝珠。'),
(1332507,'@Mythic Raid@The Weapon of the first Death Knight, Teron Gorefiend.','@Mythic Raid@第一位死亡骑士泰隆·血魔的武器。'),
(1333054,'@Mythic Raid@From beneath you it devours.','@Mythic Raid@它从你下方吞噬。'),
(1333102,'@Mythic Raid@Through the vial''s glass you can feel the warlord''s blood swirling.','@Mythic Raid@透过小瓶的玻璃，你能感到军阀的血液在旋动。'),
(1333471,'@Mythic Raid@Mildly uncomfortable for non-trolls.','@Mythic Raid@对非巨魔而言稍有不适。'),
(1333492,'@Mythic Raid@You know this blade...','@Mythic Raid@你认得这柄剑……'),
(1334010,'@Mythic Raid@The shroud fills you with a sense of peace','@Mythic Raid@这件披风让你充满宁静之感'),
(1334334,'@Mythic Raid@The energy of the Sunwell courses through Thori''dal.','@Mythic Raid@太阳之井的能量在索利达尔中奔流。'),
(1334848,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Bracer Slot items. You may Turn this in at the Tier 6 Vendor found on the Sunwell Isle.','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶护腕部位物品的通用代币。可在太阳之井高地的第 6 阶商人处兑换。'),
(1334853,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Belt Slot items. You may Turn this in at the Tier 6 Vendor found on the Sunwell Isle.','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶腰带部位物品的通用代币。可在太阳之井高地的第 6 阶商人处兑换。'),
(1334856,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 6 Boots Slot items. You may Turn this in at the Tier 6 Vendor found on the Sunwell Isle.','@Mythic Raid@这是第 6 阶靴子部位物品的通用代币。可在太阳之井高地的第 6 阶商人处兑换。'),
(1338634,'@Mythic Raid@Each side only has one eye...','@Mythic Raid@每一边都只有一只眼睛……'),
