(1339755,'@Mythic Raid@A proud fighter displays the ears of those he has slain in battle.','@Mythic Raid@一位骄傲的战士炫耀着他在战斗中所杀之敌的耳朵。'),
(1344569,'@Mythic Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Mythic Raid: Naxxramas - 10 Player@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(1344582,'@Mythic Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@This magical jewel is perfectly formed into the likeness of a blue dragon''s eye.','@Mythic Quest: Judgement at the Eye of Eternity@这颗魔法宝石完美地塑成了蓝龙之眼的形状。'),
(1344650,'@Mythic@It''s not actually Malygos''s heart. Rather it''s an object of incredible power that Alexstrasza retrieved from his body.','@Mythic@这其实并不是玛里苟斯的心脏，而是阿莱克丝塔萨从他的躯体中取出的一件蕴含惊人力量的物品。'),
(1344651,'@Mythic@A personally signed letter from the Queen''s Consort, granting its bearer the right to claim an item of their choice from the royal treasury.','@Mythic@一封女王配偶亲笔签名的信函，授予持有者从皇家宝库中任选一件物品的权利。'),
(1344831,'@Mythic Raid@Nerglish for Dummies','@Mythic Raid@纳迦语入门'),
(1347166,'@Mythic Raid@Don''t touch what you can''t afford.','@Mythic Raid@别碰你买不起的东西。'),
(1378073,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(1378109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1378128,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1378156,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1378157,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1378161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1378191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1378204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1378220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1378223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1378235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1378240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1378250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1378254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1378257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1378263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1378264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1378270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1378272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1378276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1378280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1378281,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1378285,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1378295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1378296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1378298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1378301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1378302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1378303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1378305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1378306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1378307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1378309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1378310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1378312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1378317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1378331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1378372,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(1378373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1378407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1378440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1378456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1378500,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(1378515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1378595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1378618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1378632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1378641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1378644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1378646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1378650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1378651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1378652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1378657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1378684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1378731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1378737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1378742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1378751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1378759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1378777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1378778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1378792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1378804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1378807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1378815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1378816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1378818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1378831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1378842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1378843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1378850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1378903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1378905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1378912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1378913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1378923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1378930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1378933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1378940,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1378941,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1378942,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1379016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1379017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1379034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1379042,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1379066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1379067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1379090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1379119,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1379125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1379127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1379132,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1379134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1379135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1379139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1379143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1379176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1379200,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1379201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1379209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1379215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1379216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1379231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1379236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1379242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1379243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1379265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1379275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1379277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1379283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1379287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1379296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1379297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1379309,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1379328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1379338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1379355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1379405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1379409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1379429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1379433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1379438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1379439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1379442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1379449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1379450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1379454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1379456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1379458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1379460,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1379461,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1379468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1379470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1379471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1379472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1379473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1379475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1379476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1379481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1379482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1379487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1379509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1379526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1379538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1379539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1379543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1379554,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1379559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1379569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1379579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1379584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1379593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1379672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1379705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1379862,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Unstable Fel Potion','@Worldforged@教你如何制作不稳定的邪能药水'),
(1379864,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1379903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1379910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1379912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1379918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1379921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1379925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1380073,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(1380109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1380128,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1380156,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1380157,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1380161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1380191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1380204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1380220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1380223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1380235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1380240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1380250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1380254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1380257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1380263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1380264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1380270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1380272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1380276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1380280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1380281,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1380285,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1380295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1380296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1380298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1380301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1380302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1380303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1380305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1380306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1380307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1380309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1380310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1380312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1380317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1380331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1380372,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(1380373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1380407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1380440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1380456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1380500,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(1380515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1380595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1380618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1380632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1380641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1380644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1380646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1380650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1380651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1380652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1380657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1380684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1380731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1380737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1380742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1380751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1380759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1380777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1380778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1380792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1380804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1380807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1380815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1380816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1380818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1380831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1380842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1380843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1380850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1380903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1380905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1380912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1380913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1380923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1380930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1380933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1380940,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1380941,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1380942,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1381016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1381017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1381034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1381042,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1381066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1381067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1381090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1381119,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1381125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1381127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1381132,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1381134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1381135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1381139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1381143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1381176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1381200,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1381201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1381209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1381215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1381216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1381231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1381236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1381242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1381243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1381265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1381275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1381277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1381283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1381287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1381296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1381297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1381309,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1381328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1381338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1381355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1381405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1381409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1381429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1381433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1381438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1381439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1381442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1381449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1381450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1381454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1381456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1381458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1381460,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1381461,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1381468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1381470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1381471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1381472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1381473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1381475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1381476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1381481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1381482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1381487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1381509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1381526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1381538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1381539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1381543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1381554,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1381559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1381569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1381579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1381584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1381593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1381672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1381705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1381862,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Unstable Fel Potion','@Worldforged@教你如何制作不稳定的邪能药水'),
(1381864,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1381903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1381910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1381912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1381918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1381921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1381925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1382073,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(1382109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1382128,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1382156,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1382157,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1382161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1382191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1382204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1382220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1382223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1382235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1382240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1382250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1382254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1382257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1382263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1382264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1382270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1382272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1382276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1382280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1382281,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1382285,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1382295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1382296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1382298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1382301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1382302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1382303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1382305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1382306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1382307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1382309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1382310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1382312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1382317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1382331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1382372,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(1382373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1382407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1382440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1382456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1382500,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(1382515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1382595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1382618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1382632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1382641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1382644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1382646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1382650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1382651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1382652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1382657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1382684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1382731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1382737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1382742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1382751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1382759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1382777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1382778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1382792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1382804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1382807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1382815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1382816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1382818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1382831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1382842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1382843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1382850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1382903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1382905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1382912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1382913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1382923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1382930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1382933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1382940,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1382941,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1382942,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1383016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1383017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1383034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1383042,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1383066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1383067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1383090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1383119,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1383125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1383127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1383132,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1383134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1383135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1383139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1383143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1383176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1383200,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1383201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1383209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1383215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1383216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1383231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1383236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1383242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1383243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1383265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1383275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1383277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1383283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1383287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1383296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1383297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1383309,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1383328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1383338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1383355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1383405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1383409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1383429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1383433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1383438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1383439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1383442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1383449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1383450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1383454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1383456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1383458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1383460,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1383461,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1383468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1383470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1383471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1383472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1383473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1383475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1383476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1383481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1383482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1383487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1383509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1383526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1383538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1383539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1383543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1383554,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1383559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1383569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1383579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1383584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1383593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1383672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1383705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1383862,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Unstable Fel Potion','@Worldforged@教你如何制作不稳定的邪能药水'),
(1383864,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1383903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1383910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1383912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1383918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1383921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1383925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1384073,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(1384109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1384128,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1384156,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1384157,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1384161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1384191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1384204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1384220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1384223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1384235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1384240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1384250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1384254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1384257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1384263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1384264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1384270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1384272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1384276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1384280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1384281,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1384285,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1384295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1384296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1384298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1384301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1384302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1384303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1384305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1384306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1384307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1384309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1384310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1384312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1384317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1384331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1384372,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(1384373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1384407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1384440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1384456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1384500,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(1384515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1384595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1384618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1384632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1384641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1384644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1384646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1384650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1384651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1384652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1384657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1384684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1384731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1384737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1384742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1384751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1384759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1384777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1384778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1384792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1384804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1384807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1384815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1384816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1384818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1384831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1384842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1384843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1384850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1384903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1384905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1384912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1384913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1384923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1384930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1384933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1384940,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1384941,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1384942,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1385016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1385017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1385034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1385042,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1385066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1385067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1385090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1385119,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1385125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1385127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1385132,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1385134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1385135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1385139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1385143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1385176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1385200,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1385201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1385209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1385215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1385216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1385231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1385236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1385242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1385243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1385265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1385275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1385277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1385283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1385287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1385296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1385297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1385309,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1385328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1385338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1385355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1385405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1385409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1385429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1385433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1385438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1385439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1385442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1385449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1385450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1385454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1385456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1385458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1385468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1385470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1385471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1385472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1385473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1385475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1385476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1385481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1385482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1385487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1385509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1385526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1385538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1385539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1385543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1385554,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1385559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1385569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1385579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1385584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1385593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1385672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1385705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1385862,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Unstable Fel Potion','@Worldforged@教你如何制作不稳定的邪能药水'),
(1385864,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1385903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1385910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1385912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1385918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1385921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1385925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1386073,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Vampiric Blood Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作吸血之血药水。'),
(1386109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1386128,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1386156,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1386157,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1386161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1386191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1386204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1386220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1386223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1386235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1386240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1386250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1386254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1386257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1386263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1386264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1386270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1386272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1386276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1386280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1386281,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1386285,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1386295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1386296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1386298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1386301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1386302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1386303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1386305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1386306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1386307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1386309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1386310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1386312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1386317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1386331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1386372,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Radley''s Special Scope.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作拉德利的特制瞄准镜。'),
(1386373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1386407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1386440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1386456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1386500,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make a Mossflayer Armor Patch.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作苔藓剥皮者护甲补片。'),
(1386515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1386595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1386618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1386632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1386641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1386644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1386646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1386650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1386651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1386652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1386657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1386684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1386731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1386737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1386742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1386751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1386759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1386777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1386778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1386792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1386804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1386807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1386815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1386816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1386818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1386831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1386842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1386843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1386850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1386903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1386905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1386912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1386913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1386923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1386930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1386933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1386940,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1386941,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1386942,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1387016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1387017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1387034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1387042,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1387066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1387067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1387090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1387119,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1387125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1387127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1387132,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1387134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1387135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1387139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1387143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1387176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1387200,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1387201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1387209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1387215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1387216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1387231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1387236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1387242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1387243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1387265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1387275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1387277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1387283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1387287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1387296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1387297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1387309,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1387328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1387338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1387355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1387405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1387409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1387429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1387433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1387438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1387439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1387442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1387449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1387450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1387454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1387456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1387458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1387468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1387470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1387471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1387472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1387473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1387475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1387476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1387481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1387482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1387487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1387509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1387526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1387538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1387539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1387543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1387554,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1387559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1387569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1387579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1387584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1387593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1387672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1387705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1387862,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Unstable Fel Potion','@Worldforged@教你如何制作不稳定的邪能药水'),
(1387864,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1387903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1387910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1387912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1387918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1387921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1387925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1388097,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1388116,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1388143,'@Worldforged@Healing and Mana potions can be used on separate cooldown from other potions in combat.','@Worldforged@战斗中，治疗药水与法力药水可与其他药水分开冷却使用。'),
(1388144,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make Kixxle''s Experimental Potion.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作基克斯的实验药水。'),
(1388148,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1388178,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1388191,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1388207,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1388210,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1388222,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1388227,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1388235,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1388239,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1388242,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1388248,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1388249,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1388255,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1388257,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1388260,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to make an Blue Dragonscale Kit.','@Worldforged@教你如何制作蓝色龙鳞护甲套件。'),
(1388263,'@Worldforged@Study the Winterfall Firewater before its ingredients have fully mixed and learn how to replicate it.','@Worldforged@在冬泉火酒的原料完全混合之前仔细观察，学习如何复刻它。'),
(1388282,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1388316,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1388323,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1388346,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1388360,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1388369,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1388374,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1388378,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1388379,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1388380,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1388385,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1388412,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1388459,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1388465,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1388470,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1388479,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1388487,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1388505,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1388506,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1388520,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1388532,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1388535,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1388543,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1388544,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1388546,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1388559,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1388570,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1388571,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1388631,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1388633,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1388640,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1388641,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1388651,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1388658,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1388661,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1388668,'@Worldforged@Tastes like death, feels like life.','@Worldforged@尝起来像死亡，感觉像重生。'),
(1388669,'@Worldforged@Smells like grass, but will save your...','@Worldforged@闻起来像青草，却能保住你的……'),
(1388670,'@Worldforged@If only they didn''t forget their potions.','@Worldforged@要是它们没忘带药水就好了。'),
(1388744,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1388745,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1388762,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1388770,'@Worldforged@Wait, Kodos can lay eggs?','@Worldforged@等等，科多兽会下蛋？'),
(1388794,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1388795,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1388847,'@Worldforged@Eating this will kill you... That''s it.','@Worldforged@吃了它会要你的命……就是这样。'),
(1388852,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1388854,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1388861,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1388862,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1388866,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1388870,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1388911,'@Worldforged@Crafted by Ropetown to hold Durn''s loot.','@Worldforged@由绳镇打造，用来装杜恩的战利品。'),
(1388912,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1388920,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1388926,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1388927,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1388942,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1388950,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1388951,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1388961,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1388962,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1388970,'@Worldforged@Teaches you how to summon and dismiss this companion.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','@Worldforged@教你如何召唤与解散此伙伴。\n\n这是一个非战斗伙伴。'),
(1389008,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1389012,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1389032,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1389036,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1389041,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1389042,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1389045,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1389048,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1389049,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1389054,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1389078,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1389086,'@Worldforged@To be delivered with all haste to Ravantusk Village!','@Worldforged@须以最快速度送往拉文塔斯克村！'),
(1389097,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1389102,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1389186,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1389219,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1389376,'@Worldforged@This will take the edge off... surely nothing bad will come from this.','@Worldforged@这能让你放松些……肯定不会有坏处的。'),
(1389894,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1389901,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1389903,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1389909,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1389912,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1389916,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1391460,'@Worldforged@Felhound''s are capable of regrowing their horns within a day if removed, but this lost horn seems to still contain a portion of Shahiar''s power.','@Worldforged@地狱犬的角若被割下，一天内就能重新长出，但这根掉落的角似乎仍蕴含着沙希尔的一部分力量。'),
(1392109,'@Worldforged@Also serves as a blacksmithing hammer.','@Worldforged@也可作为铁匠锤使用。'),
(1392161,'@Worldforged@Barely anything remains of this adventurer''s armor, but there might be enough left to wrap around your wrists.','@Worldforged@这位冒险者的护甲几乎没剩下什么，但或许还够缠在你的手腕上。'),
(1392191,'@Worldforged@Every light must cast a shadow.','@Worldforged@凡光必投下阴影。'),
(1392204,'@Worldforged@Several young braves had a contest to see who could throw their javelin the furthest. Only one landed too far to retrieve.','@Worldforged@几名年轻勇士比赛谁把标枪投得最远。只有一支落得太远，无法取回。'),
(1392220,'@Worldforged@Much too big for your fingers, but they look about the right size to wear on your wrists.','@Worldforged@套在手指上太大了，但看起来正好可以戴在手腕上。'),
(1392223,'@Worldforged@Somehow, you aren''t sure drawing upon the libram of a demon cult is the best idea...','@Worldforged@不知怎的，你觉得借用恶魔教派的圣契并不是什么好主意……'),
(1392235,'@Worldforged@The pale light of this lantern is accompanied by the faint sound of weeping...','@Worldforged@这盏提灯苍白的光中，伴随着隐隐的啜泣声……'),
(1392240,'@Worldforged@Once made to protect its wearer from harm, this necklace has been twisted by its proximity to the Atal''ai.','@Worldforged@这条项链本为保护佩戴者免受伤害而制，却因靠近阿塔莱而被扭曲。'),
(1392250,'@Worldforged@Even the servants of a destructive Loa need to catch food, one way or another.','@Worldforged@即便是毁灭性神灵的仆从，也总得想办法捕食。'),
(1392254,'@Worldforged@Fashioned from the teeth of a Sawtooth Snapper by an innovative murloc. Murlocs starting to invent better weaponry might not be a good sign...','@Worldforged@由一个颇具创意的鱼人用锯吻鳄鱼的牙齿制成。鱼人开始发明更好的武器，这可不是好兆头……'),
(1392257,'@Worldforged@It doesn''t seem like Swamp Talker figured out how to fire this crossbow. That''s probably for the best.','@Worldforged@沼泽语者似乎没搞明白怎么发射这把弩。这样大概最好。'),
(1392263,'@Worldforged@This looks to be a mark of leadership amongst murlocs. They must have left these huts in a hurry.','@Worldforged@这似乎是鱼人之间表示领导地位的标记。它们一定是匆忙离开了这些棚屋。'),
(1392264,'@Worldforged@It seems to have been sitting in the marsh for a very long time, but the enchantments on it have kept their power in spite of the rust.','@Worldforged@它似乎在沼泽里躺了很久，但尽管锈迹斑斑，其上的附魔仍保有力量。'),
(1392270,'@Worldforged@Seems to have been left as a memento by the builder of this odd shrine. Judging by the architecture, they must have traveled from a faraway land.','@Worldforged@似乎是这座奇异神殿的建造者留下的纪念物。从建筑风格判断，他们一定来自遥远的国度。'),
(1392272,'@Worldforged@For REALLY cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来真正砍倒大树！'),
(1392276,'@Worldforged@A tome penned by Xylem''s own hand.','@Worldforged@一本由赛尔姆亲手写就的书卷。'),
(1392280,'@Worldforged@Crafted with the finest gnomish ingenuity! The creator of this device assumes no responsibility for any other unintended side effects.','@Worldforged@以最精湛的侏儒巧思制造！本装置制造者不对任何其他意外副作用承担责任。'),
(1392295,'@Worldforged@The name engraved upon this ring has long since faded.','@Worldforged@戒指上刻着的名字早已褪色。'),
(1392296,'@Worldforged@''Zael'' is engraved upon this amulet in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@护符上以古老文字刻着“扎尔”。'),
(1392298,'@Worldforged@These gloves seem to be much more intact than the rest of their former owner.','@Worldforged@这副手套看起来比它前主人的其余部位完好得多。'),
(1392301,'@Worldforged@The sound of hoofbeats can be heard as you hold this piece of tattered cloth.','@Worldforged@握着这块破布时，你能听见蹄声。'),
(1392302,'@Worldforged@''Rae'' is engraved upon this ring in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@戒指内侧以古老文字刻着“蕾”。'),
(1392303,'@Worldforged@''Kire'' is engraved upon this blade in an ancient script.','@Worldforged@剑身上以古老文字刻着“基尔”。'),
(1392305,'@Worldforged@It seems the camp''s owner was forced to leave this circlet behind. Death would likely be the most fortunate reason...','@Worldforged@看来营地的主人被迫留下了这个头环。死亡大概是最幸运的原因……'),
(1392306,'@Worldforged@You feel only sorrow as you hold this branch in your hands.','@Worldforged@握着这根枝条，你只感到悲伤。'),
(1392307,'@Worldforged@Their screams are the monument upon which your name shall be engraved forever.','@Worldforged@他们的惨叫将成为纪念碑，你的名字将被永远铭刻其上。'),
(1392309,'@Worldforged@Clothing pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中抽出的衣物'),
(1392310,'@Worldforged@A bow pulled from the pages of a book','@Worldforged@从书页中拉出的一张弓'),
(1392312,'@Worldforged@Marked by indecipherable runes.','@Worldforged@上面刻着无法辨识的符文。'),
(1392317,'@Worldforged@A piece of a long-destroyed world that Medivh kept in his cellar as a curiosity.','@Worldforged@一块早已毁灭的世界的碎片，麦迪文曾把它当作奇珍收藏在地窖里。'),
(1392331,'@Worldforged@They say it’s for guests.','@Worldforged@他们说这是给客人用的。'),
(1392373,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1392407,'@Worldforged@Something about this blade doesn''t feel right...','@Worldforged@这柄剑总让人觉得哪里不对劲……'),
(1392440,'@Worldforged@You feel a comforting, but cold presence.','@Worldforged@你感到一股令人安心却又冰冷的存在。'),
(1392456,'@Worldforged@Feathers are the new leathers!','@Worldforged@羽毛才是新皮革！'),
(1392515,'@Worldforged@Who you gonna call? The Crusade!','@Worldforged@你要找谁？十字军！'),
(1392595,'@Worldforged@Huh, they REALLY do not like fire.','@Worldforged@哈，它们真的非常讨厌火。'),
(1392618,'@Worldforged@No one will ever reach this..','@Worldforged@没人能触及这里……'),
(1392632,'@Worldforged@Really nice, but they tend to fall down.','@Worldforged@真不错，但总会掉下来。'),
(1392641,'@Worldforged@One whiff and you’ll swear time slows. They call it a powder trance. I call it regrettable life choices.','@Worldforged@只吸一口你就会发誓时间变慢了。他们称之为粉末恍惚。我称之为令人后悔的人生选择。'),
(1392644,'@Worldforged@Lost in a battle, a trinket of forgotten pirate greed.','@Worldforged@遗失于一场战斗，一件被遗忘的海盗贪婪之物。'),
(1392646,'@Worldforged@The most exquisite exemplar.','@Worldforged@最精美的典范。'),
(1392650,'@Worldforged@Carve yer way to treasure, or foes to pieces, matey! Some just prefer the swing of an axe!','@Worldforged@用它劈开通往宝藏的路，或者把敌人砍成碎片，伙计！有些人就爱斧头的挥砍感！'),
(1392651,'@Worldforged@You can faintly hear the sea when you put your ear up to it.','@Worldforged@把耳朵贴上去，能隐约听见海的声音。'),
(1392652,'@Worldforged@They never see it coming,','@Worldforged@他们永远察觉不到，'),
(1392657,'@Worldforged@Parental Advisory Recommended - Explicit Content','@Worldforged@建议家长指导——露骨内容'),
(1392684,'@Worldforged@Not many survive it.','@Worldforged@能活下来的不多。'),
(1392731,'@Worldforged@This is only being borrowed... Right?','@Worldforged@这只是借用……对吧？'),
(1392737,'@Worldforged@Shaped from Badlands bedrock, this relic hums with the latent power of the earth. Those who wield it feel the land itself respond to their shocks and quakes, resonating with each strike.','@Worldforged@由荒芜之地的基岩塑成，这件遗物低鸣着大地的潜藏之力。持有者能感到大地本身回应其震荡与冲击，每次攻击都与之共鸣。'),
(1392742,'@Worldforged@Probably shouldn''t think about it''s previous use.','@Worldforged@大概不该去想它以前的用途。'),
(1392751,'@Worldforged@Infused with the echoing power of Martuk’s earthbind rituals, this cowl resonates with every incantation, beckoning the rock and stone to rise at your command.','@Worldforged@灌注了马图克缚地仪式的回荡之力，这顶兜帽与每次咒语共鸣，召唤岩石随你号令升起。'),
(1392759,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees!','@Worldforged@专为砍树而生！'),
(1392777,'@Worldforged@A wand sculpted out of Galgosh''s other bone.','@Worldforged@用加尔果什的另一根骨头雕成的魔杖。'),
(1392778,'@Worldforged@Do not share it with your loved ones.','@Worldforged@不要与你的亲人分享。'),
(1392792,'@Worldforged@The blade still seeps with venom drawn from scorpid; its edge hums with their lingering spite.','@Worldforged@刀锋仍渗出取自蝎子的毒液；刃口低鸣着残余的恶意。'),
(1392804,'@Worldforged@Whoever cuts the line, has to go empty the bucket.','@Worldforged@谁插队，谁就得去倒粪桶。'),
(1392807,'@Worldforged@It still glints with poison.','@Worldforged@仍闪烁着毒光。'),
(1392815,'@Worldforged@Legends tell of a lone peak where lightning strikes like clockwork, once with every full moon. \n\nThe wand''s wood was taken from a tree struck not once, but twice—its power now woven into this relic of the long-lost Thunderfalls lineage.','@Worldforged@传说有座孤峰，闪电如时钟般准时，每轮满月劈下一次。\n\n这根魔杖的木料取自一棵被击中不止一次、而是两次的树——它的力量如今编织进这件早已失落的雷霆瀑布血脉的遗物中。'),
(1392816,'@Worldforged@Guns that reliably protect you from Bandits... Mostly.','@Worldforged@能可靠地保护你免遭强盗袭击的枪械……大多数时候。'),
(1392818,'@Worldforged@You... took... Candle?','@Worldforged@你……拿了……蜡烛？'),
(1392831,'@Worldforged@That''s just a foul...','@Worldforged@那只是一次犯规……'),
(1392842,'@Worldforged@I just wish I could''ve made it to that last island. The fish are always bigger on the other side.','@Worldforged@我只希望我能去到那最后一座岛。对岸的鱼总是更大。'),
(1392843,'@Worldforged@Am I a lucky miner or what?','@Worldforged@我算不算幸运的矿工？'),
(1392850,'@Worldforged@These notes depict a Drone''s fall into madness while being experimented on.','@Worldforged@这些笔记记述了一只雄蜂在被实验过程中堕入疯狂的过程。'),
(1392903,'@Worldforged@Better not drink this, don''t know where your mind will end up...','@Worldforged@最好别喝，天知道你脑子会飘到哪儿去……'),
(1392905,'@Worldforged@Snagglerspear is infamous for using this whistle on kodo hunts, often blowing it to give his pack the signal to attack.','@Worldforged@斯纳格斯皮尔以在科多兽狩猎中使用这枚哨子而臭名昭著，常吹响它给他的兽群发出攻击信号。'),
(1392912,'@Worldforged@This Instrument belonged to Sylvannas Windrunner''s Brother. He played it for Kael''thas Sunstrider himself before the the Second War.','@Worldforged@这件乐器曾属于希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的兄弟。在第二次战争之前，他曾亲自为凯尔萨斯·逐日者演奏。'),
(1392913,'@Worldforged@A child-made offering to honor a parent who fell in battle.','@Worldforged@孩子为纪念战死双亲而制作的供品。'),
(1392923,'@Worldforged@A rare Claymore used by the highest order of Quel''thalas Guards.','@Worldforged@奎尔萨拉斯卫队最高阶层使用的稀有双手剑。'),
(1392930,'@Worldforged@You hear a faint scream from the sword.','@Worldforged@你听见剑中传来微弱的尖叫。'),
(1392933,'@Worldforged@Mankrik has lost enough already... Maybe it''s best to just put this back.','@Worldforged@曼克里克已经失去够多了……也许最好把它放回去。'),
(1393016,'@Worldforged@A twig of Bathran, a magical treant that paid the price of the Forsaken''s experiments in the area.','@Worldforged@来自巴斯兰的一根细枝，那是一位为被遗忘者的实验付出代价的魔法树人。'),
(1393017,'@Worldforged@No one likes cavities.','@Worldforged@没人喜欢蛀牙。'),
(1393034,'@Worldforged@Should you be touching this?','@Worldforged@你确定该碰这个？'),
(1393066,'@Worldforged@A glowing shard, tainted by Fel energy.','@Worldforged@一块发光的碎片，被邪能污染。'),
(1393067,'@Worldforged@Holds merely a sliver of Aessina''s power.','@Worldforged@只承载着艾森娜力量的一丝残片。'),
(1393090,'@Worldforged@Hey, as long as it works','@Worldforged@嘿，只要管用就行'),
(1393125,'@Worldforged@Etched with evil runes.','@Worldforged@刻满邪恶符文。'),
(1393127,'@Worldforged@Forgotten long ago.','@Worldforged@早已被遗忘。'),
(1393134,'@Worldforged@Surprisingly tough, fits pretty well when wrapped into a cord and tied at the waist','@Worldforged@意外地结实，搓成绳系在腰间刚刚合适'),
(1393135,'@Worldforged@Not quite sure where this has been.','@Worldforged@不太确定这东西曾经放在哪儿。'),
(1393139,'@Worldforged@For cutting down sentient walking trees!','@Worldforged@专门用来砍倒有意识的行走之树！'),
(1393143,'@Worldforged@This rune-etched hand seems to push blades aside.','@Worldforged@这只刻满符文的手似乎能把刀刃推开。'),
(1393176,'@Worldforged@An ogre must have cleaned these in the nearby moonwell','@Worldforged@准是个食人魔在旁边的月亮井里把它们洗干净的'),
(1393201,'@Worldforged@Stood in the fire slightly longer than most.','@Worldforged@在火里站得比大多数人稍久了一点。'),
(1393209,'@Worldforged@In the end, sometimes the only plan left is to run.','@Worldforged@到最后，有时唯一剩下的计划就是逃。'),
(1393215,'@Worldforged@Tempered in living flame.','@Worldforged@在活火中淬炼。'),
(1393216,'@Worldforged@Hardened by the flames it once defied.','@Worldforged@被它曾抗拒的烈焰淬炼而成。'),
(1393231,'@Worldforged@There are scratches on the inside...','@Worldforged@内侧有划痕……'),
(1393236,'@Worldforged@Severely burned by Lava Spiders...','@Worldforged@被熔岩蜘蛛严重灼伤……'),
(1393242,'@Worldforged@There are pages ripped out...','@Worldforged@有书页被撕掉了……'),
(1393243,'@Worldforged@Love and Heat go hand in hand.','@Worldforged@爱与热浪相伴而生。'),
(1393265,'@Worldforged@Directly from Overseer Maltorius'' tool collection. This has built the first Golems that started this excavation site. Sometimes it doubles down as more than a tool it seems.','@Worldforged@直接取自工头马尔托里乌斯的工具收藏。这些工具建造了开启这座挖掘场的最初几台傀儡。看来它有时还兼作别的用途。'),
(1393275,'@Worldforged@The runes on the belt pulse with power from a long forgotten era.','@Worldforged@腰带上的符文脉动着来自久远年代的遗忘之力。'),
(1393277,'@Worldforged@Armor forged for a battle long past.','@Worldforged@为早已逝去的战争锻造的护甲。'),
(1393283,'@Worldforged@One man''s trash...','@Worldforged@一个人的垃圾……'),
(1393287,'@Worldforged@These boots have seen everything.','@Worldforged@这双靴子什么场面都见过。'),
(1393296,'@Worldforged@The local wretched once followed The light, but with their bodies and minds broken, their teachings have long since been forgotten.','@Worldforged@当地的悲惨者曾追随圣光，但身心俱碎之后，他们的教义早已被遗忘。'),
(1393297,'@Worldforged@Infused with twisted magic, the metallic shard pulses with an ancient buzz.','@Worldforged@灌注着扭曲的魔法，这块金属碎片脉动着古老的嗡鸣。'),
(1393328,'@Worldforged@It makes them sleep FOREVER.','@Worldforged@它能让他们永远沉睡。'),
(1393338,'@Worldforged@Vibrates with the same frequency as the Pylons.','@Worldforged@与能量塔以相同频率振动。'),
(1393355,'@Worldforged@This throwing weapon was once part of a Fab Four collection. Don’t let the pun fool you. It still packs a hit worthy of a worldwide tour.','@Worldforged@这件投掷武器曾是“四人组”系列收藏的一部分。别被双关骗了，它打出去仍然是值得全球巡演的一击。'),
(1393405,'@Worldforged@From luring bass to blasting sass','@Worldforged@从诱捕鲈鱼到轰得人哑口无言'),
(1393409,'@Worldforged@Cool Cloak Though','@Worldforged@不过还是挺酷的斗篷'),
(1393429,'@Worldforged@Hard to see with this thing on...','@Worldforged@戴着这玩意儿真难看清……'),
(1393433,'@Worldforged@Held in your grasp, it hums softly, punctuated by faint, crackle. Perhaps it''s best left alone.','@Worldforged@握在你手中，它轻轻嗡鸣，间或发出微弱的噼啪声。也许最好别去碰它。'),
(1393438,'@Worldforged@Gotta keep the runway clean for optimal speeds','@Worldforged@保持跑道清洁才能达到最佳速度'),
(1393439,'@Worldforged@Increases Racing Speed by 300%','@Worldforged@竞速速度提高 300%'),
(1393442,'@Worldforged@Don''t let it eat the Kaboom Carrot!!','@Worldforged@别让它吃掉轰隆胡萝卜！！'),
(1393449,'@Worldforged@Carved from the body of a Cliffwalker. Judging by the furbolgs'' fate, the giants were none too happy about this.','@Worldforged@由一位崖行者的躯体雕刻而成。从熊怪的遭遇来看，巨人们对这件事可不太高兴。'),
(1393450,'@Worldforged@A soft, melodic hum resonates from this ancient lyre. You can''t help wondering how it''s remained untouched for all these years...','@Worldforged@这把古老的竖琴传出柔和悦耳的鸣响。你不禁纳闷它如何在这些年里始终未被触动……'),
(1393454,'@Worldforged@With some effort, you were finally able to remove this signet from the ancient statue.','@Worldforged@费了些力气，你终于把这枚印戒从古老雕像上取了下来。'),
(1393456,'@Worldforged@With her ship crashed, it doesn''t seem like she needs to keep one eye adapted to the dark right now.','@Worldforged@她的飞船坠毁了，看来她现在没必要再留一只眼睛适应黑暗了。'),
(1393458,'@Worldforged@Carefully insulated to protect against burns from chemicals or the stove.','@Worldforged@经过仔细绝缘处理，可防止化学品或炉火烫伤。'),
(1393468,'@Worldforged@An imitation of a much more powerful ring long since lost to time.','@Worldforged@一枚早已湮没于时间、强大得多戒指的仿制品。'),
(1393470,'@Worldforged@A metaphorical representation of Azshara''s strength, its power seems to be quite literal as well.','@Worldforged@这是艾萨拉力量的象征性体现，但其力量似乎也相当实在。'),
(1393471,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Beth''Amara Runes onto crystals like this one to ward the city, yet even that power was not enough to save it from the Sundering.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类水晶上铭刻贝萨玛拉符文以守护城市，但即便是那样的力量也未能使其免于大灾变。'),
(1393472,'@Worldforged@Eldara inscribed Markri runes onto weapons like this one to defend the city from attackers. The enchantments animating it have long since faded, but it looks to function similarly to a modern crossbow.','@Worldforged@艾尔达拉曾在此类武器上铭刻马克里符文以抵御来犯者。驱动它的附魔早已消散，但它看起来仍能像现代弩一样运作。'),
(1393473,'@Worldforged@These shoulderguards carry a faint echo of High Priest Zin-Malor’s power—an enigma that continues to baffle historians.','@Worldforged@这副护肩残留着高阶祭司辛·玛洛尔力量的微弱回响——这个谜团至今仍令历史学家困惑。'),
(1393475,'@Worldforged@No furbolg were harmed in the making of these boots.','@Worldforged@制作这双靴子时没有任何熊怪受到伤害。'),
(1393476,'@Worldforged@These lands bear the name of Her Radiance, and in her name shall we reclaim them!','@Worldforged@这些土地以光辉陛下之名命名，我们将以她的名义收复它们！'),
(1393481,'@Worldforged@The runes engraved upon this staff still glow with the power of an ancient scribe who has long since vanished from Azeroth.','@Worldforged@法杖上刻着的符文仍闪耀着一位早已从艾泽拉斯消失的古代抄写员的力量。'),
(1393482,'@Worldforged@Goblin Engineering: Remember, it only has to work once!','@Worldforged@地精工程学：记住，它只需要成功一次！'),
(1393487,'@Worldforged@Forged from farmstead iron and blessed by faithful homesteaders','@Worldforged@以农庄铁料锻造，受虔诚的拓荒者祝福'),
(1393509,'@Worldforged@Little remains of the body that once wore these pads, but the lingering magic woven into the tattered cloth still endures.','@Worldforged@曾穿戴这护肩的躯体已所剩无几，但编织进破布中的残余魔法仍在延续。'),
(1393526,'@Worldforged@Scratched by teeth and claws, this humble ring tells the final tale of a hunter who never returned from the wild.','@Worldforged@被牙齿与利爪抓得满是划痕，这枚朴素的戒指讲述着一位再没从荒野归来的猎人的最后故事。'),
(1393538,'@Worldforged@Carried by a brave knight on a quest to cleanse the evil stirring within Jintha’Alor.','@Worldforged@由一位勇敢的骑士携带，他正致力于净化辛萨罗内蠢动的邪恶。'),
(1393539,'@Worldforged@Resonates with the faint heartbeat of an ancient evil.','@Worldforged@与某个古老邪恶的微弱心跳共振。'),
(1393543,'@Worldforged@A battered handbook with entire sections scribbled out and replaced by ‘-50 DKP!’ in bold, red ink.','@Worldforged@一本破旧的手册，整段内容被划掉，并用粗体红字改写成“-50 DKP！”'),
(1393559,'@Worldforged@A faint hum speaks of a determined shaman’s last stand against the creeping Silithid hordes.','@Worldforged@微弱的嗡鸣诉说着一位坚定的萨满祭司对抗蔓延的异种虫群的最后一战。'),
(1393569,'@Worldforged@Magic from the Caverns has seeped deep into the wood, causing it to hum with quiet, timeless power.','@Worldforged@洞穴中的魔法早已深深渗入木料，使它低鸣着静谧而恒久的力量。'),
(1393579,'@Worldforged@Gets the job done.','@Worldforged@干活够用。'),
(1393584,'@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.','@Worldforged@小心，镜片已碎，别让玻璃扎进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：本物品的镜片组件已受损。请极度谨慎操作，以免被玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此受损装备所致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。使用风险自负。'),
(1393593,'@Worldforged@The seed pulses with life and you feel yourself growing an inch taller.','@Worldforged@种子脉动着生命，你觉得自己长高了一寸。'),
(1393672,'@Worldforged@Left to honor a fallen friend of the past.','@Worldforged@留下以纪念昔日陨落的朋友。'),
(1393705,'@Worldforged@For cutting down trees with both hands!','@Worldforged@专门用来双手砍树！'),
(1393903,'@Worldforged@Worn femur of a troll who lived and perished long before mankind’s first steps. Those who took the temple’s mantle of guardian did so knowing the dreadful cost of such honor: an eternity of servitude.','@Worldforged@一位早在人类迈出第一步之前就已生灭的巨魔所留下的股骨。那些接过神殿守护者衣钵的人，都是在明知这份荣誉可怕代价的情况下接受的：永恒的奴役。'),
(1393910,'@Worldforged@I confess I belong to no philosophy. I belong to the real world. For reality fits within no ideology. Such things are abstractions, comforts we embraced out of fear of asking questions without the promise of answers.','@Worldforged@我承认我不属于任何哲学。我属于现实世界，因为现实容不下任何意识形态。那些东西都是抽象概念，是我们因恐惧而在没有答案保证的情况下仍不愿发问时抱持的慰藉。'),
(1393912,'@Worldforged@Gift of the tallest warrior of Three Totems. Morriga Hollowhoof marked him from childhood, and though many years lay between them, she conspired to claim him as her mate, hoping one day to drive him against his father. She did. And he died.','@Worldforged@三图腾最雄伟的战士的赠礼。莫瑞加·空蹄自他幼时便标记了他，尽管两人相隔多年光阴，她仍谋划将他纳为配偶，期望有朝一日驱使他反抗其父。她做到了。而他死了。'),
(1393918,'@Worldforged@Lid of a coffin unearthed beside the Cain family crypt, plundered by kobolds. Their presence in these lands is rare, for they know what dwells beneath the soil… and it chills them to the marrow.','@Worldforged@凯恩家族墓穴旁被挖出的棺材盖，遭狗头人洗劫。它们在这些土地上十分罕见，因为它们知道土壤之下潜藏着什么……那令它们骨髓发寒。'),
(1393921,'@Worldforged@Helm worn by the zealots of Radiance Town. A faint tingling spreads to those who draw near. Though the cult’s origin is shrouded, some whisper of a god of radiation, who appeared before His Radiant Majesty and granted him divine purpose.','@Worldforged@光辉镇狂信徒所戴的头盔。靠近者会感到一阵微弱的刺痛。尽管该教派起源成谜，有人低语说曾有辐射之神显现于光辉陛下之前，赐予其神圣使命。'),
(1393925,'@Worldforged@Polearm fashioned from a branch of the Great Vulture’s nest. It is said the branches all once belonged to a World Tree, felled to stave off some calamity yet greater.','@Worldforged@用巨鹰巢穴的树枝制成的长柄武器。据说这些枝条原本都来自一棵世界之树，为阻止某种更巨大的灾祸而被伐倒。'),
(1397269,'@Mythic Raid@The head of the Black Dragonflight''s Brood Mother','@Mythic Raid@黑龙军团育母的头颅'),
(1397270,'@Mythic Raid@ An official document, certifying Onyxia''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n  - Overlord Runthak outside of Orgrimmar Bank.\n  - Major Mattingly outside of Trade District in Stormwind.\n  - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Mythic Raid@ 一份证明奥妮克希亚已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n  - 奥格瑞玛银行外的伦萨克督军。\n  - 暴风城贸易区外的马廷利少校。\n  - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
(1397271,'@Mythic Raid@The head of Nefarian: Brood of Deathwing.','@Mythic Raid@奈法利安——死亡之翼血脉的头颅。'),
(1397272,'@Mythic Raid@An official document, certifying Nefarian''s death.\n\nBring this document to one of the following to reap your rewards.\n - Thrall in Grommash Hold (Orgrimmar).\n - Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep (Stormwind).\n - Baron Revilgaz on the upper boat of Booty Bay inn.','@Mythic Raid@一份证明奈法利安已死的官方文件。\n\n将此文件交给下列任意一人以领取奖励。\n - 格罗玛什堡垒的萨尔（奥格瑞玛）。\n - 暴风要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根（暴风城）。\n - 藏宝海湾旅店上层船只上的雷维尔加兹男爵。'),
(1400752,'@Wrath of the Lich King@Obtained through conquering Northrend''s fiercest creatures.','@Wrath of the Lich King@通过征服诺森德最凶猛的生物获得。'),
(1402262,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Bracer Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Bracer部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402264,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Chest Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Chest部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402268,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Gloves Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Gloves部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402278,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Head Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Head部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402284,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Legs Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Legs部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402286,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Shoulder Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Shoulder部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402290,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Boots Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Boots部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1402300,'@Mythic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 3 Belt Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Mythic Raid@这是第 3 阶Belt部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1450002,'@Mythic Raid@The vial is still intact, containing a small amount of the water from the Well of Eternity.','@Mythic Raid@小瓶仍完好无损，里面装着少量永恒之井的水。'),
(1450003,'@Mythic Raid@The vial is still intact, containing a small amount of the water from the Well of Eternity.','@Mythic Raid@小瓶仍完好无损，里面装着少量永恒之井的水。'),
(1450007,'@Mythic Raid@The warglaive lost all its power with its masters death. Combine the glaive with a Intact Vial of Lady Vashj or Kael''thas Sunstrider to restoire its power.','@Mythic Raid@这柄战刃随其主人之死失去了全部力量。将它与瓦丝琪女士或凯尔萨斯·逐日者的完好药瓶合成，即可恢复其力量。'),
(1506055,'@|cFFFF8000Unfixed|r@The blade is returning to the sands, blood must be drawn...','@|cFFFF8000Unfixed|r@刀刃正在重归沙土，必须以血为祭……'),
(1506056,'@|cFFFF8000Fixed|r@To glance upon the naked blade means death for any outside the tribe.','@|cFFFF8000Fixed|r@对部族之外的人而言，瞥见裸露的刃锋就意味着死亡。'),
(1518202,'@|cffFFD700Prestigious|r@This item cannot be returned or refunded once it has been purchased.','@|cffFFD700Prestigious|r@该物品一经购买便无法退货或退款。'),
(1518203,'@|cffFFD700Prestigious|r@This item cannot be returned or refunded once it has been purchased.','@|cffFFD700Prestigious|r@该物品一经购买便无法退货或退款。'),
(1519387,'@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@Forgive me Arktos...','@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@原谅我，阿克托斯……'),
(1519388,'@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@Vengeance is the only thing left to seek.','@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@复仇是唯一剩下的目标。'),
(1519389,'@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@Bring them to their grave.','@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@送他们进坟墓。'),
(1519390,'@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@Artkos, my lone companion. Show your strength.','@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@阿科斯，我孤独的伙伴。展现你的力量。'),
(1519391,'@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@Simply touching this blade causes you to shiver.','@|cFF22FFFFFrozen Reach|r@仅是触碰这柄剑就让你打了个寒颤。'),
