(1706051,'@Ascended Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Cloak Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Ascended Raid@这是第 2.5 阶披风部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1706052,'@Ascended Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Ring Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Ascended Raid@这是第 2.5 阶戒指部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1706053,'@Ascended Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Neck Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Ascended Raid@这是第 2.5 阶颈部部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1706055,'@|cFFFF8000Ascended Raid - Unfixed|r@The blade is returning to the sands, blood must be drawn...','@|cFFFF8000Ascended Raid - Unfixed|r@刀刃正在重归沙土，必须以血为祭……'),
(1706056,'@|cFFFF8000Ascended Raid - Fixed|r@To glance upon the naked blade means death for any outside the tribe.','@|cFFFF8000Ascended Raid - Fixed|r@对部族之外的人而言，瞥见裸露的刃锋就意味着死亡。'),
