(1806051,'@Heroic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Cloak Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Heroic Raid@这是第 2.5 阶披风部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(1806052,'@Heroic Raid@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Ring Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@Heroic Raid@这是第 2.5 阶戒指部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
