(2002001,'@Dungeoneer@An Upgraded Spoils of War containing Heroic Dungeon Gear, mainly focusing on upgrading your gear for your current primary stat. \n\nThis Spoils of war is obtained from PvE Daily Quests and has a chance at bonus loot for Tanks.','@Dungeoneer@一份升级版战争物资，内含英雄地下城装备，主要针对你当前主属性来提升装备。\n\n此战争物资来自 PvE 日常任务，并有几率为坦克提供额外战利品。'),
