(6050734,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Though broken and corrupt, you can still make out the royal seal of Lordaeron.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@虽已破碎腐朽，你仍能辨认出洛丹伦的皇家封印。'),
(6050735,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A grotesque skull now rests atop the blade. Etched in blood across the axe head is one word repeated ten times: SUFFER.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@一颗怪诞的头骨如今嵌在刃上。斧头以血刻着同一个词十遍：受难。'),
(6050736,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A lying tongue hates those it crushes, but a flattering mouth works ruin.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@撒谎的舌憎恨它所伤害的人，谄媚的嘴则招致败亡。'),
(6050737,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Let our enemies know that havoc calls and that with its song comes their end.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@让我们的敌人知道，浩劫已至，它的歌声便是他们的终结。'),
(6050738,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Beneath the Scourge corruption you are able to make out a faint inscription: ...cry with me in the unified voice that will resonate to the throne of the Lich King himself! FOR THE ALLIANCE AND FOR KHAZ MODAN!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@在天灾腐化之下，你能辨出一行模糊的铭文：……与我同声哭泣吧，让这声音响彻巫妖王本人的王座！为了联盟，为了卡兹莫丹！'),
(6050791,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Even longer than your average cloak or cape.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@比你一般的斗篷或披风还要长。'),
