(6062348,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@As the earth stills, the din quiets, and your focus sharpens, strike true. -Terrath the Steady','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@当大地静止，喧嚣平息，你的专注变得锐利，便可一击命中。——沉稳的泰拉兹'),
(6062350,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The earth begins to rumble and your foes begin to tremble. You come, and destruction comes with you. -Gorsik the Tumultuous','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@大地开始轰鸣，你的敌人开始颤抖。你来了，毁灭也随之而来。——动荡者戈西克'),
(6062351,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Winds, earth, and storm may break upon your form, but your will alone will let you stand on. -Felsen the Enduring','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@风、大地与风暴或许能击打你的躯体，但唯有你的意志能让你继续站立。——坚忍者费尔森'),
