(6081565,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@451 points of light dot the surface.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@451 个光点散布在表面上。'),
(6082814,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Too powerful to be consumed by the flames.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@力量太强，不会被火焰吞噬。'),
(6085428,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@You can''t handle the truth.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你承受不了真相。'),
(6086567,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Used by Yaungol medicine men to detect changes in the weather.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@野牛人巫医用来探知天气变化。'),
(6086570,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@...and they eat puppies!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@……而且它们还吃小狗！'),
(6086572,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Imbued with powerful Mogu magic.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@灌注着强大的魔古魔法。'),
(6086576,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The sword techniques of the Mantid are a carefully-guarded secret.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@螳螂妖的剑术是严格保守的秘密。'),
(6086579,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The Mantid learned long ago how to bend the winds of Pandaria to the Empress'' will.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@螳螂妖很久以前就学会了如何令潘达利亚的风听从女皇的意志。'),
(6086585,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Considered a sign of wealth and status amongst the Saurok.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@在蜥蜴人中，它被视为财富与地位的象征。'),
(6086587,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A vibrant life energy emanates from this seed.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这颗种子散发出蓬勃的生命能量。'),
(6087421,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Always the same story. Chop, hack, and off comes the head!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@故事总是如此。劈、砍，然后脑袋就掉了！'),
(6087428,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Beneath this hood lurks a smile.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这顶兜帽之下藏着微笑。'),
(6087437,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The gems within this ring constantly shift, leaving you wondering which is truly at the top.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@戒指上的宝石不断变换，令你捉摸不透哪一颗才真正在最上面。'),
(6087443,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@What do we say to death?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@我们要对死亡说什么？'),
(6087455,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Sharp enough to see for two men.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@锋利得足以让两个人看清。'),
(6087456,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A man with a friend is never without vision.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@有朋友的人，从不缺少视野。'),
(6087474,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Sparkling energy crackles through every grain of the wood.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@闪耀的能量在木材的每道纹理间噼啪作响。'),
(6087512,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A bit of slime drips slowly from the flange.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@少许黏液正从法兰缓慢滴下。'),
(6087570,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Soldiers arise, stand and fight!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@士兵们，起来，挺身而战！'),
(6087571,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The Grim Guzzler''s brawls are epic tales of legend.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@灰罐酒馆的斗殴是传说中的史诗故事。'),
(6087572,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Never stops twice.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@从不会停两次。'),
(6087573,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Reeking and rock hard.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@臭气熏天，硬如岩石。'),
(6087574,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Enchanted to fit perfectly beneath any mug, with a frosty finish.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@施了附魔，可完美垫在任意酒杯之下，表面覆着一层霜。'),
(6088868,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The fleas offer no defensive benefit.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这些跳蚤不提供任何防御加成。'),
(6089081,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A gift from Snow Blossom, Destroyer of Men','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@来自“男人终结者”雪花的礼物'),
(6089611,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Artifact details have already been logged in your Archaeology Journal, under the Completed Artifacts tab.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@神器详情已记录在考古日志的“已完成神器”标签页中。'),
(6089684,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Artifact details have already been logged in your Archaeology Journal, under the Completed Artifacts tab.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@神器详情已记录在考古日志的“已完成神器”标签页中。'),
(6090200,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A sexy ass dagger','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@一把性感至极的匕首'),
(6090578,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Stained by the tears of the sky.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@被天空的泪水浸染。'),
(6092782,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The blood of the footman it was taken from has left a permanent stain.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@它取下的那名步兵的血，留下了永久的污渍。'),
(6092783,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Several gash marks indicate that the grunt did not part with it willingly.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@数道割痕表明这位步兵并非自愿舍它而去。'),
(6092784,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A stolen manual detailing closely-guarded fighting techniques of the Alliance.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@一本被盗的手册，详述联盟严密守护的战斗技艺。'),
(6092785,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Pilfered information on the Kor''kron''s brutal techniques.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@窃得的关于库卡隆残酷战法的情报。'),
(6092786,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Torn from the grasp of a powerful alliance admiral.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@从一位强大的联盟上将手中夺取。'),
(6092787,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Torn from the grip of a powerful horde warleader.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@从一位强大的部落战帅手中夺取。'),
(6093269,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The fleas offer no defensive benefit.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这些跳蚤不提供任何防御加成。'),
(6093276,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Striding always onwards in our hearts.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@永远在我们心中前行。'),
(6093278,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The fleas offer no defensive benefit.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这些跳蚤不提供任何防御加成。'),
(6094826,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Does not seem very sporting.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@看起来不太讲体育精神。'),
(6095050,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Proof positive you pack a punch.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你出手有力，这便是确凿证明。'),
(6095051,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Proof positive you pack a punch.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你出手有力，这便是确凿证明。'),
(6095426,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A cold chill flows from the scythe.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@镰刀散发着刺骨寒意。'),
(6095506,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The blood of his foes drips eternally from the blade.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@敌人的血永远从剑刃上滴落。'),
(6095866,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The blood of his foes drips eternally from the blade.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@敌人的血永远从剑刃上滴落。'),
(6096610,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The blood of his foes drips eternally from the blade.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@敌人的血永远从剑刃上滴落。'),
(6098000,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The last hope of the Dark Iron still lives on.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@黑铁矮人最后的希望仍在延续。'),
(6098001,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The last hope of the Dark Iron still lives on.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@黑铁矮人最后的希望仍在延续。'),
(6098571,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Ornated with purple runes that radiate a magic aura this artifact is quite valuable to buyers - or maybe you could find a way to harness its power for yourself?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@饰有散发魔法灵光的紫色符文，这件神器对买家而言价值不菲——或许你也能找到驾驭其力量的办法？'),
(6100573,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The ring becons to you.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@戒指在召唤你。'),
(6100574,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A swirling tempest surrounds the ring.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@一圈翻涌的暴风环绕着这枚戒指。'),
(6100575,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@You do not think anything you could attempt would destroy this ring.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你不认为你所做的任何尝试能摧毁这枚戒指。'),
(6100580,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@''N.P'' is engraved on the inner band.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@内环刻着“N.P”。'),
(6101010,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Deeply engraved into the hilt reads For not a man has wielded this sword who did not deserve it outright.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@剑柄深处刻着：凡持此剑者，无不当之。'),
(6110400,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Ornated with purple runes that radiate a magic aura this artifact is quite valuable to buyers - or maybe you could find a way to harness its power for yourself?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@饰有散发魔法灵光的紫色符文，这件神器对买家而言价值不菲——或许你也能找到驾驭其力量的办法？'),
(6110401,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Ornated with purple runes that radiate a magic aura this artifact is quite valuable to buyers - or maybe you could find a way to harness its power for yourself?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@饰有散发魔法灵光的紫色符文，这件神器对买家而言价值不菲——或许你也能找到驾驭其力量的办法？'),
(6122880,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The weapon has been infused with Strange Energy.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这件武器已被注入奇异能量。'),
(6155000,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@I Can See Right Into Your Soul, Mon','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@我能看穿你的灵魂，老兄'),
(6155001,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Your Safe As Long As I Watch Over You','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@只要我在看着你，你就是安全的'),
(6155002,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Where Do Your Friendships Lie?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你的友谊究竟归于何处？'),
(6155003,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@You Look Mighty Tasty','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@你看起来非常美味'),
(6199797,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Only the Firman family can be accepted by this great power','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@只有菲尔曼家族才能被这股强大力量接纳'),
(6253151,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Just as Elune may conceal the light of the sun, so too has a dark star been eclipsed by the dream.\nYet even the longest eclipse is but a brief moment to the history of the cosmos...','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@正如艾露恩能遮蔽太阳之光，一颗暗星也已被梦境吞噬。\n然而即便最长的蚀相，在宇宙的历史中也只是一瞬……'),
(6253634,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@I screamed but no one answered\nI wept but no tears came\nI reached out to take your hand\nAnd finally I realized what I''d become','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@我尖叫，却无人回应\n我哭泣，却无泪可流\n我伸手去牵你的手\n终于我明白自己已成了什么'),
(6254672,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@No matter what, as long as you have this, I''m sure I''ll be able to find you. So there''s no need to cry, okay Miel?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@无论如何，只要你有这个，我一定能找到你。所以不必哭了，好吗，米尔？'),
(6255677,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Just as Elune may conceal the light of the sun, so too has a dark star been eclipsed by the dream.\nYet even the longest eclipse is but a brief moment to the history of the cosmos...','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@正如艾露恩能遮蔽太阳之光，一颗暗星也已被梦境吞噬。\n然而即便最长的蚀相，在宇宙的历史中也只是一瞬……'),
(6255809,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@I screamed but no one answered\nI wept but no tears came\nI reached out to take your hand\nAnd finally I realized what I''d become','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@我尖叫，却无人回应\n我哭泣，却无泪可流\n我伸手去牵你的手\n终于我明白自己已成了什么'),
(6259537,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@No matter what, as long as you have this, I''m sure I''ll be able to find you. So there''s no need to cry, okay Miel?','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@无论如何，只要你有这个，我一定能找到你。所以不必哭了，好吗，米尔？'),
(6278980,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Shake your Muffinmaker!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@摇动你的玛芬制造机！'),
(6300096,'@Arena Exclusive@Apply this Weapon Illusion using Wardrobe UI.','@Arena Exclusive@通过衣柜界面使用此武器幻象。'),
(6300097,'@Arena Exclusive@Apply this Weapon Illusion using Wardrobe UI.','@Arena Exclusive@通过衣柜界面使用此武器幻象。'),
(6300522,'Apply this Weapon Illusion at any Transmogrifier or Directly in your Wardrobe. Does not affect Temporary Weapon Enchantment apperances!','在任意幻化师处或直接在衣柜中应用此武器幻象。不影响临时武器附魔的外观！'),
(6300533,'@Arena Exclusive@Apply this Weapon Illusion using Wardrobe UI.','@Arena Exclusive@通过衣柜界面使用此武器幻象。'),
(6300535,'@Arena Exclusive@Apply this Weapon Illusion using Wardrobe UI.','@Arena Exclusive@通过衣柜界面使用此武器幻象。'),
