(6300800,'Complete a Mythic dungeon to receive a level 2 Keystone.','完成一次史诗难度地下城，即可获得一枚 2 级钥石。'),
(6311273,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@Aydreath believed himself a noble protector of nature, but he was nothing more than a common beast in the end.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@艾德瑞斯自认为是自然的高贵守护者，但到头来他不过是一头寻常野兽。'),
(6311275,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@You need not see the world around you. Listen only to their voice, and you will destroy it.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@你无需看清周遭的世界。只听他们的声音，你就会摧毁它。'),
(6311277,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The druid raged against our masters, but his rage turned to madness, and his madness became a part of them.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@那德鲁伊曾对我们的主人怒吼，但他的愤怒化作了疯狂，而他的疯狂成了他们的一部分。'),
(6311326,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@In the city of Ny''alotha many thing dream forever. You will join them. All will join them.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@在尼奥罗萨之城，许多事物永远沉眠于梦中。你将加入它们。万物都将加入它们。'),
(6315900,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The ultimate fusion of vibration and cutting technology','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@振动与切割技术的终极融合'),
(6318803,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@Property of Finkle Einhorn, Grandmaster Adventurer','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@芬克尔·艾因霍恩的财产，冒险者宗师'),
(6319364,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The initials A.L. are etched on the hilt.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@剑柄上刻着首字母 A.L.。'),
(6319378,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The threading is unlike anything you have ever seen. It appears metallic in origin.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@这线料与你见过的任何东西都不同，看起来源自金属。'),
(6319379,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@A silver liquid flows within the impenetrable ebony shell. The item feels pure. It radiates an essence of extreme power.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@银色液体在无法穿透的乌木外壳中流动。这件物品纯净无比，散发着极致力量的气息。'),
(6319380,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The metal is warm to the touch. The links connecting the belt together appear to be fashioned out of Elementium.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@金属摸起来是温的。连接腰带的链环似乎由源质制成。'),
(6319390,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@A cold chill passes through your spine as you place your hands on these gloves. They appear to be made from the skin of whelplings - a lot of whelplings.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@当你把手放进这副手套时，一股寒意窜过脊椎。它们似乎是用雏龙的皮做的——很多很多雏龙。'),
(6319396,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The flesh from different dragon flights has been sewn together to make this belt.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@这条腰带由不同龙军团的皮肉缝合而成。'),
(6319866,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The seething flames of hatred.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@翻腾的憎恨之焰。'),
(6319901,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@Also serves as a skinning knife.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@也可作为剥皮小刀使用。'),
(6319947,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@The inscription reads: Fer really long castin''.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@铭文写着：超～长～读～条。'),
(6347166,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@Don''t touch what you can''t afford.','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@别碰你买不起的东西。'),
(6483475,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Soaked in the demonic blood of Rage Incarnate.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@浸透了怒之化身的恶魔之血。'),
(6496235,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Only a true champion can weild this weapon.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@唯有真正的勇士才能挥动这柄武器。'),
(6496236,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Dream as if you''ll live forever. Live as if you''ll die today.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@像会永生般去梦想。像会今天就死般去生活。'),
(6507310,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This staff has the power to heal all within range.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这柄法杖能治疗范围内所有目标。'),
(6507312,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@At the break of the Winter Solistice, when Santacow came in the. . . dead of night . . .','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@冬至破晓之时，桑塔牛于……死寂之夜降临……'),
(6507370,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Still In Business.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@仍在营业。'),
(6507371,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Not Going Down.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@绝不倒下。'),
(6510005,'@Ascended Raid@Only the Hard. Only the Strong.','@Ascended Raid@唯有坚韧。唯有强者。'),
(6510007,'@Ascended Raid@Rise Above Death','@Ascended Raid@超越死亡'),
(6512690,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@The Divine Light protects me.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@圣光护佑我。'),
(6553634,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@I screamed but no one answered\nI wept but no tears came\nI reached out to take your hand\nAnd finally I realized what I''d become','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@我尖叫，却无人回应\n我哭泣，却无泪可流\n我伸手去牵你的手\n终于我明白自己已成了什么'),
(6554672,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@No matter what, as long as you have this, I''m sure I''ll be able to find you. So there''s no need to cry, okay Miel?','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@无论如何，只要你有这个，我一定能找到你。所以不必哭了，好吗，米尔？'),
(6555677,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@Just as Elune may conceal the light of the sun, so too has a dark star been eclipsed by the dream.\nYet even the longest eclipse is but a brief moment to the history of the cosmos...','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@正如艾露恩能遮蔽太阳之光，一颗暗星也已被梦境吞噬。\n然而即便最长的蚀相，在宇宙的历史中也只是一瞬……'),
(6555809,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@I screamed but no one answered\nI wept but no tears came\nI reached out to take your hand\nAnd finally I realized what I''d become','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@我尖叫，却无人回应\n我哭泣，却无泪可流\n我伸手去牵你的手\n终于我明白自己已成了什么'),
(6559537,'@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@No matter what, as long as you have this, I''m sure I''ll be able to find you. So there''s no need to cry, okay Miel?','@|cFFCC0000Heroic Bloodforged|r@无论如何，只要你有这个，我一定能找到你。所以不必哭了，好吗，米尔？'),
(6571120,'Contains Purges and Scrolls of Talent Unlearning.','内含净化术与遗忘天赋卷轴。'),
(6699810,'@Ascended Raid@Countless lives have ceased to exist from the wrath of this blade. It''s name Amarth is an Elvish word meaning Doom, very fitting for a blade that has ended so many!','@Ascended Raid@已有无数生命因这柄剑的狂怒而消逝。它名为“阿玛斯”，在精灵语中意为“末日”，对这柄终结了如此多生命的剑来说再合适不过！'),
(6800000,'@Ascended Raid@Bring this tome to Lethelyn','@Ascended Raid@将此书卷交给蕾瑟琳'),
(6900003,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Caustic Wow Staff''s Uniform','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@腐化巨魔法杖的制服'),
(6900004,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Caustic Wow Staff''s Uniform','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@腐化巨魔法杖的制服'),
