(6900092,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Allows you to see the world for how it really is.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@让你看清世界的真正模样。'),
(6950791,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Even longer than your average cloak or cape.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@比你一般的斗篷或披风还要长。'),
(6991000,'@Ascended Raid@Only the Hard. Only the Strong.','@Ascended Raid@唯有坚韧。唯有强者。'),
(6991003,'@Ascended Raid@Rise Above Death','@Ascended Raid@超越死亡'),
(6991004,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@A heavy pressure leaks from the heart of this weapon.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@沉重的压力自武器核心渗出。'),
(6991012,'@Ascended Raid@I''m probably AFK','@Ascended Raid@我大概在挂机'),
(6991018,'@Ascended Raid@May your strength be the Holy Light.','@Ascended Raid@愿你的力量成为圣光。'),
(7000000,'Contains Saronite Bombs.  Lots of them.','内含萨隆邪铁炸弹。很多很多。'),
(7038175,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Soldiers arise, stand and fight!','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@士兵们，起来，挺身而战！'),
(7038287,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@It''s definitely not half full.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@它绝对不是半满。'),
(7038288,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Not very filling.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@不太顶饿。'),
(7038289,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@Perfect for bouncing off tables.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@非常适合在桌上弹跳。'),
(7506050,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This unique watch is distorting time.','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这块奇特的怀表正在扭曲时间。'),
(7506051,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Cloak Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这是第 2.5 阶披风部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(7506052,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Ring Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这是第 2.5 阶戒指部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(7506053,'@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@This Token is a Global Token for Tier 2.5 Neck Slot items. This is Exchangeable at a Vendor found in Stormwind (Major Mattingly) or Orgrimmar (Overlord Runthak).','@|cFFCC0000Bloodforged|r@这是第 2.5 阶颈部部位物品的通用代币。可在暴风城（马廷利少校）或奥格瑞玛（伦萨克督军）的商人处兑换。'),
(7506055,'@|cFFFF8000Bloodforged - Unfixed|r@The blade is returning to the sands, blood must be drawn...','@|cFFFF8000Bloodforged - Unfixed|r@刀刃正在重归沙土，必须以血为祭……'),
(7506056,'@|cFFFF8000Bloodforged - Fixed|r@To glance upon the naked blade means death for any outside the tribe.','@|cFFFF8000Bloodforged - Fixed|r@对部族之外的人而言，瞥见裸露的刃锋就意味着死亡。'),
(8006827,'This Satchel Contains Purges and Scroll of Talent Unlearning.','此背包内含净化术与遗忘天赋卷轴。'),
(8111111,'There should be loot here, if you see me, message Sinstalis.','这里本该有战利品。若你看到我，请给辛斯塔利斯留言。'),
(8180467,'Felforged Souls can be used to redeem consumable and account-wide rewards in the Twisting Nether from your master Qormaladon.\n\nSouls can be earned from Quests, Fel Challenges, and Hero Kills.','邪铸灵魂可用于在扭曲虚空中向你的主人科玛拉顿兑换消耗品与账号共享奖励。\n\n灵魂可通过任务、邪能挑战与英雄击杀获得。'),
(8180468,'Resurrects and converts your Fel-Touched Ironman character to a normal character.','复活被邪能触碰的钢铁侠角色，并将其转为普通角色。'),
(8180472,'Allows you to alter the look of your armor.','允许你改变护甲的外观。'),
(8200009,'Teaches you how to summon Blinky.\n\nThis is a non-combat companion.','教你如何召唤布林奇。\n\n这是一个非战斗宠物。'),
(8200089,'The tail seems perfectly preserved.','尾巴似乎保存得十分完好。'),
(8200090,'The head is intact and doesn''t seem to have any visible deformaties.','头部完好，看不出任何明显的变形。'),
(8200091,'The forelegs are mostly intact - besides the torn nails and blood stained fur that is.','两条前腿大体完好——当然，除去撕裂的爪子和沾血的皮毛。'),
(8200092,'The hindlegs are strong and have a good amount of muscle still on them.','后腿强劲，仍保有相当多的肌肉。'),
(8200169,'Equip your Adventurer''s Purple Backpack','装备你的冒险者紫色背包'),
(8200171,'Equip your Adventurer''s Light Brown Backpack','装备你的冒险者浅棕色背包'),
(8200177,'Teaches you how to summon this mount. This is a Ground mount. \n\nViscidous''s last meal...','教你如何召唤此坐骑。这是一个地面坐骑。\n\n维西杜斯的最后一餐……'),
(8210123,'Activate wings sititched by nightmare.','激活由梦魇缝合而成的双翼。'),
(8263152,'@Mythic 3@The title reads "The Brode to Nowhere"','@Mythic 3@标题写着“通往虚无的布罗德”'),
(8263154,'@Mythic 3@The title reads "The Brode to Nowhere"','@Mythic 3@标题写着“通往虚无的布罗德”'),
(8263501,'Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher''s Stone.\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r','分配器可用作：\n旋轮微型调节器、\n弧光扳手、\n铁匠锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n名匠铭文工具、\n哲人石。\n\n|cffFF0000摧毁此物品将失去全部升级！|r'),
(8263502,'Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher''s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Arcanite Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r','分配器可用作：\n旋轮微型调节器、\n弧光扳手、\n铁匠锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n名匠铭文工具、\n哲人石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文奥金棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000摧毁此物品将失去全部升级！|r'),
(8263503,'Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher''s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Eternium Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r','分配器可用作：\n旋轮微型调节器、\n弧光扳手、\n铁匠锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n名匠铭文工具、\n哲人石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文恒金棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000摧毁此物品将失去全部升级！|r'),
(8263504,'Dispenser serves as:\nGyromatic Micro-Adjuster,\nArclight Spanner,\nBlacksmithing Hammer,\nMining Pick,\nSkinning Knife,\nLumber Axe,\nVirtuoso Inking Set,\nPhilosopher''s Stone.\n|cff00ff00Upgrades:\nRuned Titanium Rod|r\n\n|cffFF0000ALL Upgrades are lost if this item is destroyed!|r','分配器可用作：\n旋轮微型调节器、\n弧光扳手、\n铁匠锤、\n矿工锄、\n剥皮小刀、\n伐木斧、\n名匠铭文工具、\n哲人石。\n|cff00ff00升级：\n符文泰坦神铁棒|r\n\n|cffFF0000摧毁此物品将失去全部升级！|r'),
(8263512,'Woven from ethereal threads, this curious relic pulses with latent energy.','由虚空之线织就，这件奇异的遗物澎湃着潜藏的能量。'),
(9025000,'A heavy branch torn from Thornroot at Iris Lake.','从艾瑞斯湖的刺根身上撕下的一根粗枝。'),
(9025001,'A sharpened blackthorn splinter from an ancient guardian.','一位远古守护者身上取下的一根磨利黑刺李碎片。'),
(9025002,'Living bark lacquered with pale sap from Iris Lake.','用艾瑞斯湖的苍白树液上漆的活树皮。'),
(9025003,'Layered leather overgrown with thorny Ashenvale creepers.','叠层皮革上长满了灰谷带刺的藤蔓。'),
(9025004,'A moonlit bloom sealed in polished wildwood.','一朵封在打磨过的野木中的月光花。'),
(9025005,'A dense slab of living bark hardened by the lake shore.','一块被湖岸硬化了的致密活树皮。'),
(9200557,'A finely crafted blade that seems to drink in the shadows around it.','一柄做工精良的剑，似乎会吸收周围的暗影。'),
(9200570,'A stone tablet etched with runes that pulse with barely contained rage.','一块刻着符文、脉动着几乎压抑不住的愤怒的石板。'),
(9200571,'An ancient scroll stained with blood that still appears wet after countless years.','一卷沾满血迹的古老卷轴，历经无数岁月仍显得湿漉漉的。'),
(9200572,'A manuscript covered in shifting symbols that seem to writhe when observed.','一份覆满变幻符号的手稿，那些符号被注视时似乎在扭动。'),
(9200573,'A demonic contract that burns with green flames yet never consumes.','一份燃着绿色火焰却永不燃尽的恶魔契约。'),
(9200574,'A steel tablet inscribed with protective wards that shimmer with defensive magic.','一块钢制石板，刻着闪烁防御魔法的守护符文。'),
(9200575,'A proclamation sealed with shadow, bearing the mark of the Knights of Xoroth.','一份以暗影封印的公告，带有索洛骑士团的印记。'),
(9200576,'An ancient codex bound in bone, inscribed with necromantic secrets.','一本以骨骼装订的古老典籍，记载着死灵法术的秘辛。'),
(9200577,'A scroll that seems to age and renew before your eyes, defying time itself.','一卷在你眼前似在衰老又重焕新生的卷轴，公然违逆时间本身。'),
(9200578,'A charred tome still warm to the touch, flickering with ember light.','一本烧焦的书卷，摸起来仍温热，闪烁着余烬之光。'),
(9200579,'A weathered guide marked with tracks from countless beasts.','一本风霜侵蚀的指南，标记着无数野兽的足迹。'),
(9200580,'A stone tablet covered in glowing runes of extraordinary permanence.','一块覆满发光符文的石板，符文异常持久。'),
(9200582,'Golden pages that glow with divine radiance.','散发神圣光辉的金色书页。'),
(9200583,'A blessed document sealed with holy light.','一份以圣光封印的蒙福文件。'),
(9200584,'Blueprints depicting devices that blend magic and machinery.','描绘魔法与机械结合装置的蓝图。'),
(9200585,'A sealed vial containing notes on transformative toxins.','一只密封小瓶，内附关于转化毒素的笔记。'),
(9200586,'A ritual object decorated with bones and dark charms.','一件以骨骼与黑暗护符装饰的仪式用具。'),
(9200587,'A sealed letter bearing the burning mark of the Inquisition.','一封带有宗教裁判所灼印的密封信件。'),
(9200800,'A charred tome still warm to the touch, containing fire secrets.','一本烧焦的书卷，摸起来仍温热，记载着火焰的奥秘。'),
(9200801,'A manuscript covered in shifting symbols that whisper dark truths.','一份覆满变幻符号的手稿，那些符号低语着黑暗真相。'),
(9200802,'Star maps showing the dance of celestial bodies.','描绘天体之舞的星图。'),
(9200803,'A golden scripture blessed by An''she.','受安舍祝福的金色经文。'),
(9200804,'A stone covered in glowing ancestral runes.','一块覆满发光先祖符文的石头。'),
(9200805,'A totem pulsing with raw elemental energy.','一根脉动着原始元素能量的图腾。'),
(9200806,'A clay tablet inscribed with protective wards of the Earthmother.','一块刻有大地母亲守护符文的陶土板。'),
(9200808,'A stone tablet carved with ancient Tauren runes of fury.','一块刻着牛头人古老狂怒符文的石板。'),
(9200810,'A leather-bound guide marked with beast tracks of the plains.','一本皮面指南，标记着平原上野兽的足迹。'),
(9200811,'A torn leather satchel, its surface stiff with dried blood.','一个破旧的皮挎包，表面被干涸的血黏得发硬。'),
(9200812,'An ancient tome bound in dark leather, inscribed with golden runes. The pages emanate a faint holy aura.','一本以深色皮革装订的古老书卷，刻有金色符文。书页散发着微弱的圣光气息。');

UPDATE `item_template` AS `a`
JOIN `zz_coa_zhcn_item_desc_map` AS `m` ON `m`.`entry` = `a`.`entry`
SET `a`.`description` = `m`.`dst`
WHERE `a`.`description` = `m`.`src`;

DROP TABLE `zz_coa_zhcn_item_desc_map`;
